<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">DZAÃ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ékel Dzaã</para>
  <para style="toc2">Dzaã</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dzã</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ékel</para>
  <para style="mt1">Dzaã</para>
  <para style="imt">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃swɛn-ɔ̃nkaan wu eli mtam Dzaã. Ndɛ oli ɔ̃yio a Yeso wu ɔ̃tio. Dzaã onge wu áswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu mpɛɛ̃-ã-mpɛɛ̃ mvel wu ɛ̃kuũ-mpuɔ̃ (80) ye wu ɛ̃kuũ-bva (90) ke bviil li Efedze, bviil li enɛn, k'ɔ̃kiri wu abeta me Tuuki meba ŋã.</para>
  <para style="ip">M'ãtsam ã Dzaã, baal b'eyuɔɔl ndɛ ɔ̃nkaan wu ayɛɛ ãyɛɛn y'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ Yeso mi aswɛn onse Matie, Maak ye Luk. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn ndɛ k'adzii k'aswɛn ãndɔɔ amamã m'eswɛn bakyɛ wɛ. Dzaã oli kɛn a ndyam wu ayɛɛn m'ãtee ã Mãsia mãkyɛ bvool m'ãndɔɔ m'ãtal omwiĩ o ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi alweel m'ãywɛn mɛn b'atsiɔ áli ye kɔɔ e mɔ. Onse ãtee omɔ̃, ekoo k'etsiɔ oburu bo nsa yuaal onse ɔ̃sam a ndɛ ye Nikodem (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 3:1-36">3.1-36</ref></char>), omwɛɛn o Yeso y'ɔ̃kaal wa Samali (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 4:1-42">4.1-42</ref></char>), oseel o Ladzaal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 11:1-44">11.1-44</ref></char>), y'ãtee m'ãkyɛ bvool. Dzaã odzii k'asuo b'atsiɔ ɔ̃nkaan wu kwɛn Yeso ndyam oli Mãsia wu ékekiaal Afi-Isalayel, oli Muaan a Nziã wu oyi bɔ elaã owa bvool oli Ɔ̃mvuul a okiri (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 4:42">4.42</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Okam mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi éswɛn Dzaã ye yi éswɛn bakyɛ emɔɔn m'emfa ki édzuu Mfam Yeso. Emfa okyɛ emɔɔn m'otaal b'oli mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a ndɛ y'ataal a ndɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Akoo k'akab ɔ̃nkaan wu m'ebaal etyel.</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse ebaal ki ɛ̃kwel, Dzaã asuo kwɛn fa ŋ'ébɛɛn Yeso ɔ̃sal a ndɛ, okab osam mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a b'ákeyoo ndɛ: Bɛn akiool ndɛ wuo aluɛɛn a ndɛ, bɛn akam bvool adza ndɛ ɔ̃nywã (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-4:54">1.1–4.54</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse ebaal ki bviaal, Dzaã asuo kwɛn ambiri b'Ayuda ákebva Yeso ãmbal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 5:1-12:50">5.1–12.50</ref></char>). Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ wɛn ndiri wu áyuɔɔl me ndɔɔ yi atsweel m'emwɛn ndɛ ye m'eyoo ndɛ ola Nziã (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 3:32">3.32</ref></char>), olieel ndiri ndɛ onduru mwɛn: Ndɛ olieel ndiri ndɛ oli elaã li esuul baal ndii, oli oyɔɔl b'opaal baal onse empeel, oli otaa-taa b'opaal baal onse mfya. M'ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, ndɛ ŋ'asuo ndiri ndɛ ndyam Mfam.</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse ãndɔɔ mbueel m'eyɛɛn Yeso omɔ̃, bɛn akoo k'abam ndɛ me mbyel, bɛn akoo k'akiool. Baal bibi ákeliaal ndiri ndɛ akesiaan Nziã, kɛn a bakyɛ alɔ okiool onse ntam wu ɛ̃kam ondɛ, ndiri: «Mfam, bee ola nã èyi? Yɛ li y'ãyɛɛn m'ãwa elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu.» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">6.68</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse ebaal ki etyel, Dzaã asuo kwɛn otaal b'ósi mvel tyel obɔ, oyesiɛɛn ke mbal yi ábvi Yeso y'ɔ̃nge-ngel wu éwi baal ndɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13:1-19:42">13.1–19.42</ref></char>). Kɛn a Yeso wu ebam baal b'aywɛn okiool, Nziã oseel ndɛ ɔ̃bu onse b'ákwi-ákwi. M'emfa okyɛ, ndɛ osuo kwɛn Yeso oli ɔ̃nkinkyam bvool kwɛn ãyɛɛn ã ndɛ ãli mã taa-taa. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ŋ'ekiool Toma otaa-taa b'ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, ndɛ olieel m'ãyɛɛn mã: «Mfam a mɛ̃, Nziã a mɛ̃!» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20:28">20.28</ref></char>). Obɔ otsɛn bɛn Dzaã asɔɔ ola b'atsiɔɔl ɔ̃nkaan a ndɛ k'akal y'okiool onge Toma. Ndɛ olieel ndiri ãndɔɔ m'ákel omɔ̃, «ákel mɔ̃ kwɛn byɛ ekiool wɛn Yeso oli Mãsia, Muaan a Nziã. Ŋɛn byɛ ekiool ndɛ, byɛ ebɔɔ elaã me nkuũ a ndɛ.» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20:31">20.31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">K'osɛɛl b'ɔ̃nkaan, Dzaã ayɛɛn m'ɔ̃sal wu esa Piɛɛl ye wu esa «ɔ̃yio a Yeso wu ɔ̃tio» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21.1-25</ref></char>). Ndɛ wu «ɔ̃yio a Yeso wu ɔ̃tio» wu ákel, ayio a ndɛ atsweel: «Ɔ̃yio ondɛ wuwu, mbuul wu atsweel ãndɔɔ mã, bvool oswɛn mɔ̃. Bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn m'etsweel ndɛ ãli taa-taa.» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 21:24">21.24</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Endɔɔ eyii Mbuul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />K'obɛɛn éli Endɔɔ. Endɔɔ éli ye Nziã. Endɔɔ éli Nziã. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Lɔ éli k'obɛɛn ye Nziã. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Ási eluɔ bvieel me nkuul a lɔ. K'eli y'eluɔ ki ási kyɛn k'ási me lɔ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Onse lɔ, éli y'elaã. Elaã éli mwiĩ a baal. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Mwiĩ ákenyɛɛn onse lepeel, kɛn a lepeel k'ekwaal otsɛn o ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Éli ye mbuul wu éyuɔɔl Nziã, wɛn nkuũ Dzaã. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Ndɛ áyi onge mwɛn, me ndɔɔ yi atsweel mwiĩ, kwɛn baal bueel akal y'okiool me nkuul a ndɛ wu mwiĩ. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Ndyam k'áli mwiĩ wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ áyi me ndɔɔ yi atsweel mwiĩ. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Endɔɔ olɔ éli mwiĩ wa taa-taa, wɛn ŋ'eyi ndɛ onse ɔ̃kiri, oyɛɛl baal bueel. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Endɔɔ éli onse ɔ̃kiri. Ási ɔ̃kiri me nkuul a lɔ, kɛn ɔ̃kiri k'áyɛɛ lɔ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Lɔ eyi ola baal a lɔ, kɛn a baal a lɔ k'ayɔɔ lɔ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Kɛn a baal bueel b'ayɔɔ lɔ, b'akiool nkuũ a lɔ, lɔ ewi bɔ okwɛn b'akal baan a Nziã. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Bɔ k'ayii baan a Nziã m'oburu b'ombuul wɛ, m'efua ki ombuul wɛ, m'ãtsam m'ɔ̃lam hɛ̃ wɛ, kɛn a m'ãtsam ã Nziã. <verse eid="JHN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Endɔɔ ekɔɔl mbuul. Mbuul ondɛ okal onse bia-byɛ. Ndɛ oluul me dzii y'otaa-taa. Bia-byɛ emwɛn omfam o ndɛ, omfam b'ensuu e muaan wu ofi ola Taal. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Dzaã otsweel ndɛ, bu abiool ndiri: «Ndɛ wu éyɛɛn mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, ndiri: “Mbuul wu àya ke mbee a mɛ̃ onduru mɛ̃, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ áli ɛ̃kwel ɛ̃ mɛ̃.”» <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Me dzii ngamfɛn li edzii ndɛ bia-byɛ bueel, ndɛ owi bia-byɛ ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl b'onduru ɔ̃ndel. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, áwi bia-byɛ ngel me nkuul a Moyize, kɛn a nyiĩ y'otaa-taa eyi me nkuul a Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ mwɛn-éndɛɛl kɛn amwɛn Nziã wɛ. Kɛn a ensuu e Muaan ngɔmɔ̃ wu oli Nziã, wu oli onse bal e Tal, ndɛ wu osuo baal Nziã.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oyɛɛn o Dzaã me ndɔɔ a ndyam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Tal emfa ki étsweel Dzaã Yeso, me lio lɛn, fa Yelusalem, amfam b'Ayuda áyuɔɔl angaa-a-Nziã y'alebvit ola ndɛ, m'ofuul o ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ ndyam nã li?» <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Dzaã k'abee k'awa ɔ̃mveel wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ oyɛɛn bam kal-a-kal ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ke ndi Mãsia wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Bɔ afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Obobɔ, ye nã li? Yɛ Eli li?» Dzaã obveel ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, mɛ̃ ke ndi ndɛ wɛ!» Bɔ bvool afuul ndiri: «Yɛ ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã li?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Det 18.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat 11.14</ref></char></note>» Ndɛ obveel ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃!» <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Bɔ bu alieel ndiri: «Ke yɛ nã li, kwɛn bee eyɛɛ b'ebveel bee b'atam bee. B'eyɛɛn yɛ me ndɔɔ a yam omã?» <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Ndɛ obveel ndiri: «Mɛ̃, Mɛ̃ ndi mbuul wu abebiool nkal ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ, ndiri: Eseel nkuul me ndɔɔ a Mfam, onge b'élieel Edzayi wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Edz 40.3</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Onkyel ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, b'áyi ontam obɔ áli Afalisaye. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Bɔ bvool afuul Dzaã ndiri: «Yɛ wɛn yɛ ke Mãsia wɛ, yɛ k'Eli wɛ, yɛ hɛ̃ k'ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã wɛ, k'otsɛn omã b'ebewa yɛ baal opongo?» <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Dzaã obveel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ewa byɛ opongo b'ãdza, kɛn onse byɛ, eli ye wɛn byɛ k'eyɛɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Ndɛ àya ke mbee a mɛ̃, kɛn a mɛ̃ ke mvaan m'onyiɔɔn b'ɛ̃sii mi asimpal a ndɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãkebwel k'ola bo Betani, ongwel a nzal yi Dzolodɛ̃, ke mboo yi ékewa Dzaã baal opongo.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oli Muaan a emɛmɛɛ̃ e Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Ela esiool, Dzaã omwɛn Yeso ayeya ola ndɛ, ndɛ bu alieel ndiri: «Etal Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ e Nziã, ki embaal obi b'ɔ̃kiri! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ndɛ wu éyɛɛn mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, ndiri: “Mbuul wu àya ke mbee a mɛ̃ onduru mɛ̃, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ áli ɛ̃kwel ɛ̃ mɛ̃.” <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Myam k'ekeyɛɛ ndɛ wɛ. Kɛn a mɛ̃ ye ngwa opongo b'ãdza, kwɛn ndɛ amɔɔn ol'Isalayel.» <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Dzaã opio ɔ̃liɛɛn bubu: «Mɛ̃ mwɛn Ɔ̃fel ofi ywel osool onge kuun, bu abvi nkal a ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Myam k'ekeyɛɛ ndɛ wɛ, kɛn a wu atam mɛ̃ opongo b'ãdza owa, ndɛ ondɛ wu alieel mɛ̃ ndiri: “Mbuul wu èmwɛn yɛ Ɔ̃fel asool bvool àkal nkal a ndɛ, ndɛ ondɛ wu àwa baal opongo b'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal.” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Mɛ̃ mwɛn, obɔ otsɛn bɛn mɛ̃ nsweel wɛn ndɛ oli Muaan a Nziã.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayio a Yeso b'ɛ̃kwel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Ela esiool, Dzaã bvool áli oŋɔ̃ y'ayio a ndɛ buaal. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ Yeso abwel, ndɛ olieel bubu: «Tal Muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ e Nziã!» <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Ŋ'eyoo ayio ange-buaal ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, bɔ anɔɔn a Yeso. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yeso okɔɔl, omwɛn kwɛn bɔ abenɔɔn a ndɛ, ndɛ bu afuul bɔ bubu: «Byɛ emã ebebii?» Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Rabbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.38 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rabbi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">eli m'ɔ̃nywã w'Alamɛɛ̃</char></note>, yɛ kwɛn abekal?» Rabbi ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri «ɔ̃tee.» <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Eya, byɛ èmwɛn! Bɔ ayi, bu amwɛn mboo yi ékekal ndɛ.» Bɔ bu akal ye ndɛ tsoo olɔ. Lio al'eyii li ãnã ŋ'emeekɔɔl tal. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andele wu muaan-ngoo a Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl áli ngɔmɔ̃ onse ayio ange-buaal b'áyoo ãyɛɛn ã Dzaã bvool ánɔɔn a Yeso. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ndɛ omwɛɛn ye muaan-ngoo a ndɛ Simɔ̃, bvool olieel ndɛ bubu: «Bee emwɛɛn ye Mãsia», ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri «Kilisito.» <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Ndɛ obiri Simɔ̃ ola Yeso. Yeso otal Simɔ̃, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ li Simɔ̃ wu muaan a Dzaã. Nkuũ a yɛ èkal Sefas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.42 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sefas</char><char style="ft" closed="false">eli m'ɔ̃nywã wu Alamɛɛ̃.</char></note>, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri Piɛɛl.»<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipe ye Natanahel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Ela esiool, Yeso okuru k'ayi nsie yi Ngalile. Ndɛ omwɛɛn ye Filipe, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Luɛɛn a mɛ̃!» <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipe áli wa bviil li Betesayida, li ékekal Andele ye Piɛɛl. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipe omwɛɛn ye Natanahel, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Bee emwɛn mbuul wɛn Moyize onse Ngel ákel me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, bvool wɛn aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ákel me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. Mbuul ondɛ Yeso wu muaan a Dzedzef wa Nadzalet.» <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanahel olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Eluɔ ki ngesɛ hɛ̃ olɔ efi Nadzalet?» Filipe obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ya bvool mwɛn!» <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Ŋ'emwɛn Yeso Natanahel aya ola ndɛ, ndɛ oyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ndɛ ndiri: «Tal ɔ̃fi-Isalayel wa taa-taa wɛn onse ndɛ pfuru pyɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanahel ofuul Yeso ndiri: «Yɛ mɛ̃ kwɛn yɛɛ?» Ndɛ obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ye k'eta Filipe yɛ mbel, ŋ'eli yɛ ke nsɛn ɔ̃ti a fig, mɛ̃ emwɛn yɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanahel obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Rabbi, wu oli Muaan a Nziã yɛ, wu oli Ɔ̃kwɛn a Isalayel yɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Me ndɔɔ yi ndieel mɛ̃ yɛ wɛn mɛ̃ emwɛn yɛ ke nsɛn ɔ̃ti a fig, yɛ kiool mɛ̃? Yɛ akieel amwɛn ãndɔɔ m'ãnduru okuun.» <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Yeso olweel ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, byɛ ekieel emwɛn ywel kal-a-kal, ãnzwel ã Nziã ãyi ywel ãsool ke ywel a Muaan a mbuul.»<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bal ke Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Ke mbee ãtsoo mbuaal, éli ye bal k'ola bo Kana, ke Ngalile. Ngoo a Yeso áli oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Áti Yeso hɛ̃ mbel ke bal olɔ, y'ayio a ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Onge bɛn mbal ã bvine ãywɛn, ngoo a Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Bɔ k'abekal ye mbal wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Kɛn a Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ngu, ndɔɔ mã mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a bia-yɛ? Lio e mɛ̃ kɛn ekoo wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Ngoo a Yeso olieel asal ndiri: «Esa mbueel m'ètam ndɛ byɛ osa.» <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Oŋɔ̃, éli y'ãmbuu ãsɛɛn m'ábuo m'ãnkɔɔn, m'ékesa Ayuda ɛ̃kiri mi osuɔɔl o nzuru. Mbuu bwɛn a mbuu éli m'alitele onse ab'ɔ̃nkam (100). <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yeso olieel asal ndiri: «Eluul ãmbuu mã m'ãdza. Bɔ aluul mɔ̃ ãpal mpu.» <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Ndɛ bu alieel bɔ ndiri: «Oŋɔ̃ etob ãdza omɔ̃, ebiri mɔ̃ ola mfam a pfuun.» Bɔ abiri mɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Mfam a pfuun ombio ãdza m'ãkɔɔl mbal ã bvine. Ndɛ k'áyɛɛ mboo yi éfi mɔ̃ wɛ, kɛn asal b'átob ãdza áyɛɛ. Ndɛ oti ɔ̃baal mbel, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mbuul wueel abewa baal mbal m'ãnduru obvie ɛ̃kwel, baal mɔ̃ ãbɔɔ, ndɛ fi abewa m'ãnkuaal-a-nkuaal. Bɛn yɛ bu kwee m'ãnduru obvie tiil meba!» <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Okyɛ emvieel ki ɛ̃kwel ki ési Yeso ke Kana ke nsie yi Ngalile. Ndɛ osuo omfam o ndɛ, ayio bu alɔ okiool onse ndɛ.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oyɛn Kapelanahum ye ngoo a ndɛ, ye baan-ngoo a ndɛ, y'ayio a ndɛ. Bɔ asi ãtso ke kwɛ okɔ.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso onse Nzɔ a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Pfuun li Onduru li Ayuda al'eyii tsotsoo, Yeso bu ayɛn Yelusalem. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Onse ekɔɔ e Nzɔ a Nziã, ndɛ oyemwɛn baal atiɔ angwɛmbɛ, y'emɛmɛɛ̃, y'ãkuun. Ndɛ omwɛn hɛ̃ b'ákeswɛɛl nzi me nsɛn. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Ndɛ obuo sukɔrɔ m'ɛ̃sii mi akool-kool, bu atswɛɛl bɔ ke Nzɔ a Nziã, y'emɛmɛɛ̃, y'angwɛmbɛ. Ndɛ opoo nzi e b'ákeswɛɛl yɔ, ofɛɛn amisa. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Ndɛ olieel b'atiɔ ãkuun bubu: «Embaal eluɔ obvɛ bvieel! Ebee Nzɔ a tal a mɛ̃ nzɔ a obɔɔ̃ okaal!» <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Ayio a ndɛ bu ayeyeel m'ákel ndiri: «Mfam, dzii li nzii mɛ̃ Nzɔ a yɛ edziool mɛ̃ onge mbaa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:10">Ãnz 69.10</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Ayuda abvuru oyɛɛn, afuul ndɛ bubu: «Emvieel emã kyɛn yɛ koo k'asuo bee kwɛn awi yɛ nkuul yi asa obobɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yeso bu abveel bɔ bubu: «Etsal Nzɔ a Nziã yi, mɛ̃ ètuu yɔ bvool m'ãtsoo ãtyel.» <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Ayuda abveel ndɛ bubu: «Ési mvel ãku-ãnã ye sɛɛn m'otuu o Nzɔ a Nziã yi, bɛn yɛ bu atɛɛl yɔ m'ãtsoo ãtyel?» <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Kɛn a Nzɔ a Nziã yi ékeyɛɛn ndɛ, éli nzuru a ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ŋ'ésiool ndɛ onse b'ákwi-ákwi, ayio a ndɛ ayeel kwɛn ndɛ ál'ayɛɛn obobɔ. Bɔ bu olɔ okiool onse m'ákel y'endɔɔ li élieel Yeso.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oyɛɛ ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ baal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Ŋ'éli ndɛ ke Yelusalem, ke pfuun li Onduru, baal bibi alɔ okiool onse ndɛ, ŋ'emwɛn bɔ emvieel bvi ékesa ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Kɛn a ndɛ k'ákelɔ ɔ̃kwal onse bɔ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ ákeyɛɛ bɔ bueel. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Ndɛ hɛ̃ k'áli ye kɔɔ kwɛn ayɛɛn ndɛ ndɔɔ me b'otal mbuul wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ ákeyɛɛ m'ãli onse mbuul me ndyam.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso ye Nikodem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Onse nkel a afalisaye, éli ye mfam a Ayuda ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Nikodem. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Ndɛ oyebɔɔ Yeso me tsia, bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Rabbi, bee eyɛɛ kwɛn yɛ li ɔ̃tee wu ofi ola Nziã. Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul k'akoo m'osa b'emvieel bvi ebesa yɛ ndyam wɛ, okɛɛn Nziã k'ali ye ndɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɛ wɛn, okɛɛn k'aburu mbuul bo nsa yuaal wɛ, ndɛ k'akoo k'amwɛn Okwɛn o Nziã wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodem ofuul Yeso bubu: «Emfa emã ki aburu mbuul bo nsa yuaal ŋ'emeeyal ndɛ? Ndɛ okoo m'osam bvool onse mwiĩ a ngoo, kwɛn aburu ndɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɛ wɛn, mbuul k'akoo m'osam Okwɛn o Nziã wɛ, okɛɛn k'aburu ndɛ m'oburu b'ãdza y'Ɔ̃fel wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Wu eburu mbuul oli mbuul. Wu eburu Ɔ̃fel oli ɔ̃fel. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Bee okam me ndɔɔ yi ngyɛɛn mɛ̃ wɛn ebvaan aburu byɛ m'oburu bo ywel. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Mfel apob m'etswi ki edzii ndɛ. Yɛ ayoo ndɛ, kɛn a yɛ ke yɛɛ mboo yi efi ndɛ wɛ, ekal yi eyi ndɛ. Eli emfa kiki me mbuul wu aburu m'Ɔ̃fel.» <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodem bvool olieel ndɛ ndiri: «ndɔɔ yi m'emfa okyɛ bwɛn-a-bwɛn asa yɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ mpii ɔ̃tee k'Isalayel li, yɛ ke yɛɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ wɛ? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɛ wɛn bee eyɛɛn me m'eyɛɛ bee, bee etsweel m'emwɛn bee. Kɛn a byɛ k'ekiool m'etsweel bee wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn ye byɛ m'ãndɔɔ mã nsie, byɛ k'ekiool wɛ, ke byɛ ekiool bwɛn-a-bwɛn, okɛɛn mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn ye byɛ m'ãndɔɔ mã ywel? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Mbuul wu oyɛn ywel pyɛ, okɛɛn ke wu ofi ywel wɛ, eli Muaan a mbuul. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Emfa kyɛn Moyize ándɛɛl ntaal wa bvieel onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ, emfa kiki hɛ̃ ebvaan andɛɛl Muaan a mbuul<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Ɛ̃bv 21.9</ref></char></note>, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />kwɛn mbuul ndyam wueel wu okiool ndɛ, abɔɔ elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã odzii baal b'ɔ̃kiri ngamfɛn. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ndɛ owi ensuu e ndɛ e Muaan ngɔmɔ̃, kwɛn mbuul ndyam wueel wu akiool ndɛ, abee odziɔɔn, kɛn a ndɛ abɔɔ elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Taa-taa bam, Nziã k'ayuɔɔl Muaan a ndɛ m'ɔ̃kiri m'owa o baal etumbu wɛ. Ndɛ oyuɔɔl ndɛ, kwɛn ɔ̃kiri abvuul me ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Mbuul wu olɔ okiool onse ndɛ k'abɔɔ etumbu wɛ. Kɛn a wɛn k'akiool wɛ, ŋ'amaabɔɔ etumbu, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ k'alɔ okiool onse ensuu e Muaan a Nziã ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Etumbu okyɛ eli bubu: Mwiĩ oyi onse ɔ̃kiri, baal adzii empeel ke mboo a mwiĩ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ ɛ̃li ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul ndyam wueel wu asa obi abyal mwiĩ. Ndɛ k'aya ke mwiĩ wɛ, kwɛn ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ ɛ̃bee omɔɔn. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Kɛn a wu oli onse otaa-taa aya ke mwiĩ, me ndɔɔ yɛn baal amwɛn kwɛn ndɛ asa ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ m'emfa ki edzii Nziã.»<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso ye Dzaã Batis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oyi nsie yi Yude y'ayio a ndɛ. Oŋɔ̃, ndɛ osi ãtsoo ye bɔ bvool ákewa baal opongo. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Dzaã hɛ̃ ákewa baal opongo k'Enon tsotsoo ye Salim, ke ngwel wɛ mboo oyɔ éli y'ãdza bibi. Baal ákeya oŋɔ̃ m'owal b'opongo. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Nzal-a-ŋɛn, ale kɛn alɔ Dzaã me bwal wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, ɛ̃tsuun ɛ̃bvi mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ ayio a Dzaã y'Ɔ̃yuda ngɔmɔ̃ me ndɔɔ ɛ̃kiri mi osuɔɔl o nzuru. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Bɔ ayebɔɔ Dzaã, bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Rabbi, mbuul wu áli ye yɛ ongwel a Dzolodɛ̃, wɛn yɛ, yɛ átsweel ndɛ, oyii awa baal opongo, bvool baal bueel abeya ola ndɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Dzaã obveel ndiri: «Mbuul abebɔɔ kɛn a ki awi ndɛ fa ywel. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Byɛ eyoo m'ãtswi ã byam k'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ wɛn: “Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ke ndi Mãsia wɛ, kɛn ayuɔɔl mɛ̃ ke nkwel a ndɛ.” <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Wu oli y'ɔ̃kal wu abaal, eli ɔ̃baal. Kɛn a nga-ndoo a ɔ̃baal wu otɛɛn oŋɔ̃, bvool ayoo ndɛ, oli y'esɛ ki enɛn ŋ'eyoo ndɛ ɔ̃baal ayɛɛn. Okyɛ emfa kyɛn esɛ ki mɛ̃ ekoo nzuru. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Ebvaan ndɛ ayi nkwel, kwɛn mɛ̃ mvool mbee.»<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wu ofi ywel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />«Mbuul wu ofi ywel onduru bueel. Wa nsie wa nsie, ãyɛɛn ã ndɛ mã nsie. Wu ofi ywel onduru bueel. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Ndɛ ayɛɛn me m'emwɛn ndɛ ye m'eyoo ndɛ, kɛn a mbuul k'akiool m'etsweel ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Wu okiool m'etsweel ndɛ, ŋ'asuo kal-a-kal kwɛn Nziã oli wa taa-taa. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu eyuɔɔl Nziã ayɛɛn ãyɛɛn ã Nziã, nzal-a-ŋɛn Nziã awa ndɛ Ɔ̃fel a ndɛ ndel pyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tal odzii Muaan, bu awi eluɔ bvieel me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Mbuul wu olɔ okiool onse Muaan oli y'elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu, kɛn a wɛn k'alweel Muaan wɛ k'àkal y'elaã wɛ, mpuru a Nziã eli nkal a ndɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso y'ɔ̃samali wu ɔ̃kaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Afalisaye ayoo ndiri Yeso onduru Dzaã m'ayio y'owa b'opongo. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Ke yam, wu ákewa baal opongo k'éli Yeso ndyam wɛ, éli ayio a ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Obobɔ, ndɛ ombal nsie yi Yude, bu ayɛn nsie yi Ngalile. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Kɛn ebvaan ndɛ abwel me li nsie yi Samali. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Ndɛ bu ayetɔ bviil ngelemɔ̃ li Samali lɛn nkuũ Siswaal, tsotsoo a nguun yi éwi Dzakab muaan a ndɛ Dzedzef. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Ɔ̃tob a Dzakab áli oŋɔ̃. Onge bɛn Yeso al'amaawɔɔl me dzwɛ, ndɛ obvi nsɛn nku-a-nku ɔ̃tob ondɛ. Al'eyii sua tal dzu. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃fi-Samali oyetiɔ ãdza. Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Wa mɛ̃ ãdza!» <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Ayio a ndɛ al'amaayi onse bviil, m'osuun o bvi-odza. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Ɔ̃kaal ondɛ obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ke bwɛn-ndoo! Yɛ okal Ɔ̃yuda, yɛ yii asɔɔ ãdza ola mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃kaal wa Samali?» Ndɛ oyɛɛn obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn Ayuda k'áli ye bvoo ye baal a Samali wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Okɛɛn yɛ ayɛɛ kab e Nziã ye wu asɔɔ ãdza ola yɛ, yɛ kɛn wu akaasɔɔ mɔ̃ ola ndɛ, ndɛ akaawa yɛ ãdza m'ãwa elaã.» <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Ɔ̃kaal oyɛɛn ndiri: «Taal, yɛ mpii eluɔ ki atiɔ ãdza pyɛ, ɔ̃tob kwɛn wa ye dzio! Obobɔ, yɛ ãdza m'ãwa elaã omɔ̃ kwɛn àbɔɔ mɔ̃? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Yɛ ndyam nduru nkiɔɔn a bee Dzakab wu áwi bee ɔ̃tob wu, ánywi ãdza ã ndɛ, ndɛ ye baan a ndɛ, y'ebueel e ndɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Mbuul ndyam wueel wu anywã ãdza mã àyoo nzuaal bvool. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Kɛn a wu akieel anywã ãdza mɛn mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ekieel ewa ndɛ, ndɛ kieel k'ayoo nzuaal lio si ngelemɔ̃ wɛ: Ãdza m'ekieel ewa mɛ̃ ndɛ ãkieel ãkɔɔl ɔ̃tswɛ a mvieel wu akieel atsa tiil elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu.» <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Ɔ̃kaal olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Taal, wa mɛ̃ ãdza omɔ̃, kwɛn mɛ̃ bvool mbee ye nzuaal obekal, bvool mbee ãdza obeya otiɔ ŋã.» <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yi, ta ɔ̃lam a yɛ mbel, oŋɔ̃ bvool ŋã!» <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Ɔ̃kaal obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ke ndi y'ɔ̃lam wɛ!» Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ li y'ɔ̃dzoo wu ayɛɛn wɛn: “Mɛ̃ ke ndi y'ɔ̃lam wɛ!” <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, yɛ amaabɔɔ alam ataan, wu eli a yɛ meba ŋã, k'ali ɔ̃lam a yɛ wɛ. Yɛ ndɔɔ-a-ndɔɔ yɛɛn.» <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Ɔ̃kaal olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Taal, mɛ̃ mwɛn kwɛn yɛ, yɛ li ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Ankiɔɔn a bee ábvi ãbuo m'obuɛɛn nkal a nkio yi, kɛn a byɛ, byɛ etɔ m'oyɛɛn wɛn mboo yɛn ebvaan abva ãbuo m'obuɛɛn ke Yelusalem.» <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yeso olieel ndɛ bubu: «Ngu, kiool m'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ yɛ: Lio eya lɛn k'àbebva ãbuo m'obuɛɛn o Taal ekal nkal a nkio yi, ekal ke Yeslusalem wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Byɛ baal a Samali, byɛ ebebuɛɛn wɛn byɛ k'eyɛɛ wɛ, kɛn a bee b'Ayuda, bee ebebuɛɛn wu eyɛɛ bee. Ke ngwel wɛ, obvuul ofa ol'Ayuda. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Kɛn a lio eya, lɔ lam emeeya lɛn abuɛɛn ba taa-taa akieel abuɛɛn Taal onse Ɔ̃fel y'otaa-taa. Ke ngwel wɛ, abuɛɛn ba m'emfa okyɛ, b'ebebii Taal. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Nziã oli Ɔ̃fel, ebvaan kwɛn b'abuɛɛn ndɛ, abuɛɛn ndɛ onse ɔ̃fel bvool onse otaa-taa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Ɔ̃kaal olieel ndɛ bubu: «Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ kwɛn Mãsia àya. Ŋ'èya ndɛ, ndɛ akieel àbɛɛl bee mbueel. Mãsia, wu ata me Kilisito.» <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mãsia mɛ̃ wu ebeyɛɛn ye yɛ wu!»<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Me lio olɔ, ayio ayebvool. Bɔ akam ŋ'emwɛn bɔ Yeso ayɛɛn y'ɔ̃kaal. Kɛn a mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ k'afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Ki ebii yɛ emã?» wuo: «Ndɔɔ yi ebeyɛɛn yɛ ye ndɛ mã?» <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Ɔ̃kaal osiil mbuu a ndɛ, oyɛn onse bviil, bu alieel baal ndiri: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />«Eyetal! Bɔɔl ngelemɔ̃ eli ku, wu olieel mɛ̃ mbueel me nsi mɛ̃! Ondɛ olɔ k'ekal Mãsia wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Bɔ apal onse bviil, bu ayi ola Yeso. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Kwɛn ŋɛn ayio abeliaal Yeso ndiri: «Rabbi, dza!» <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Kɛn a ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ edza bvi-odza bvɛn byɛ, byɛ k'eyɛɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Ayio ayɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Mbuul ndɛ bvi-odza awi?» <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yeso olieel bɔ ndiri: «Bvi-odza e mɛ̃, ŋ'esa mɛ̃ b'edzii wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃, y'osa b'ɔ̃sal a ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Byɛ, byɛ ebeyɛɛn wɛn: “Eli kɛn ye nswii nã tiil ŋ'ekoo lio li aka nsia”, k'obobɔ wɛ? Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, eseel mviil bvool etal ãnguun, nsia emeebie, kwɛn aka yɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Wu aka abɔɔ furu bvool abvool nsia me ndɔɔ elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu, kwɛn wu akwɛn ye wu aka asia mpaa mboo mɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />M'emfa okyɛ, ndɔɔ yi abeyɛɛn yi eli taa-taa: “Wɛn okwɛn, wɛn oki.” <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ntam byɛ eyeka bvɛn byɛ k'ésal wɛ. Baal akyam asal, kɛn a byɛ, byɛ eyeka nsia yi ɔ̃sal a bɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Baal a Samali bibi ba bviil olɔ alɔ okiool onse Yeso me ndɔɔ yɛn ɔ̃kaal ondɛ átsweel ndɛ ndiri: «Ndɛ olieel mɛ̃ mbueel mɛ̃ nsi mɛ̃.» <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Obobɔ, ŋ'eyi baal a Samali ola Yeso, bɔ aluɔɔn ndɛ k'akal kɛn ye bɔ. Ndɛ bu asi ãtsoo mbuaal oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Baal bam bibi bvool akiool Yeso me ndɔɔ ãyɛɛn ã ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Bɔ ákeyɛɛn ɔ̃kaal ondɛ bubu: «Bee k'ekiool kɛn a me ndɔɔ a ãyɛɛn ã yɛ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bee eyoo ndɛ bee myam. Bee eyɛɛ wɛn ndɛ bam oli Ɔ̃mvuul a ɔ̃kiri.»<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso obvuul muaan a ɔ̃sal a ngafuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Ke mbee ãtsoo mbuaal omɔ̃, Yeso ombal oŋɔ̃, oyɛn Ngalile. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndyam ákeyɛɛn kal-a-kal ndiri k'abewa ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn dzuun k'ola o ndyam wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Ŋ'eyi ndɛ Ngalile, baal a Ngalile ayɔɔ ndɛ ngesɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ámwɛn mbueel m'ési ndɛ ke Yelusalem me lio li pfuun. Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ hɛ̃ áli ke pfuun. <verse eid="JHN 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Ndɛ obvool Kana ke Ngalile, ke mboo yi ékaal ndɛ ãdza mbal ã bvine.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:46">Ke Kapelanahum, éli y'ɔ̃sal a ngafuru wu ɔ̃nɛn wɛn muaan áli y'ãluu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Ŋ'eyoo ndɛ ndiri Yeso ombal Yude oyi Ngalile, ndɛ oyeluɔɔn ndɛ kwɛn ndɛ ayeboo ndɛ muaan wɛn aleyii akɔɔ y'epfu. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Okɛɛn byɛ k'emwɛn eliĩ y'emwã wɛ, byɛ k'ekiool wɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Ɔ̃sal a ngafuru obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, ya ola mɛ̃ ye k'ekwa mɛ̃ muaan!» <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yi, muaan a yɛ oli mwiĩ. Ndɛ okiool b'elieel Yeso ndɛ, bu ayɛn.» <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Ŋ'eyii ebvool ndɛ ola, asal a ndɛ ayemwɛɛn ye ndɛ, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Muaan a yɛ oli mwiĩ!» <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Ndɛ ofuul bɔ ndiri: «Lio emã li eyoo ndɛ nzuru ngesɛ?» Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Al'eli ãtsio me lio li ɛ̃kwel ŋ'emeebɔɔn tal, ŋ'efi ndɛ bal.» <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Tal bu ayeyɛɛ kwɛn eli bam me lio olɔ, li eyɛɛn Yeso ndiri: «Muaan a yɛ oli mwiĩ!» Ndɛ bu ayii ɔ̃kiool, ndɛ ye nzɔ a ndɛ yueel. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Okyɛ eliĩ ki bviaal ki ési Yeso, ŋ'embal ndɛ Yude oyi Ngalile.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Obvuul o nga-elyam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, éli ye pfuun li Ayuda, Yeso bu ayɛn Yelusalem. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, ke Yelusalem okɔ, éli y'edzii ngemɔ̃ ki ata m'ɔ̃nywã wu Ebele me Betedzata, tsotsoo a ɔ̃nywã wu emɛmɛɛ̃. Kyɛ éli m'ãpfoo ãtaan. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Ke nsɛn edzoo obvɛ, éli y'embuul bibi ki anga-ãluu: Ɛ̃nkwa-mviil, anga-elyam, y'ekal. [Bɔ ákekiaal kwɛn ãdza ãndziool nzuru. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Ke ngwel wɛ, m'ãlio mãkyɛ ãnzwel ã Mfam ngãmɔ̃ ãkesool onse edzii bvool ãkenziool ãdza. Nga-ãluu wu ɛ̃kwel wu ákesool onse ãdza m'ãnziool nzuru ákebvuul, oluu o ndɛ okal k'omã.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi, k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ. </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Oŋɔ̃ éli ye mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn oluu ómoosa mvel ãku-ãtyel ye mpuɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yeso omwɛn ndɛ bɔ. Onge bɛn ndɛ oyɛɛ kwɛn mbuul ondɛ amaayiil oŋɔ̃, ndɛ ofuul ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ dzii k'akal nzuru kɛɛ-kɛɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Nga-ãluu obveel ndiri: «Taal, mɛ̃ ke ndi ye mbuul wu atyal mɛ̃ onse edzii wɛ, ŋ'enziool ãdza nzuru. Ŋe ngyii esyal mɛ̃, oŋɔ̃ mbuul ɔ̃kyam osool ɛ̃kwel ɛ̃ mɛ̃.» <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yeso bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Tɛɛn, wal ekal e yɛ, bvool dzuu!» <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Kɛn ɛ̃kiri-anka, mbuul ondɛ oyii nzuru kɛɛ-kɛɛ. Ndɛ owel ekal e ndɛ, bu abvi odzuu. Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, tsoo olɔ éli li saba. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Obobɔ, Ayuda ákeyɛɛn mbuul wu ábvuul ondɛ ndiri: «Nonɔ̃ eli saba, k'awi yɛ nkuul yi abiri ekal e yɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Kɛn a ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Mbuul wu abvuul mɛ̃, wu alieel mɛ̃ ndiri: “Wal ekal e yɛ, bvool dzuu!”» <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Bɔ afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Mbuul wu alieel yɛ ndiri: “Wal ekal e yɛ, bvool dzuu nã”?» <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Kɛn a mbuul wu ábvuul ondɛ k'áyɛɛ wu ábvuul ndɛ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ Yeso ál'adziɔɔn. Nzal-a-ŋɛn embuul e baal éli ke mboo oyɔ.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso omwɛn ndɛ onse Nzɔ a Nziã, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ bu bvuul obɔ, oŋɔ̃ bee ãbi obesa, kwɛn ndɔɔ yi enduru obii ebee me yɛ obetɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Mbuul ondɛ oyeliaal Ayuda ndiri Yeso mbuul wu aboo ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Ayuda bu abvi Yeso oweel, ɔ̃tswɛ-pa wu ési ndɛ ndɔɔ oyɔ me tsoo e saba. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Tal a mɛ̃ abesal tiil meba, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ebesal.» <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn Ayuda bvool ayii abii ndɛ bam wu abam, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ ákesiaan saba, bvool ákeyɛɛn ndiri Nziã oli Tal a ndyam, m'emfa okyɛ ndɛ ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri ndɛ ye Nziã ali emfa ngemɔ̃.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omfam o Muaan a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />«Yeso abvuru oyɛɛn, olieel bɔ ndiri: Taa-taa bam mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, Muaan k'akoo k'asa ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ me ndyam wɛ. Ndɔɔ yi esa ndɛ, yi emwɛn ndɛ Tal asa. Ndɔɔ yueel yi esa Tal, muaan hɛ̃ asa yɔ emfa kiki. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Tal odzii muaan, bvool abesuo ndɛ mbueel m'esa ndɛ. Ndɛ bvool akieel asuo ndɛ ãndɔɔ m'ãnduru okuun, kwɛn byɛ, byɛ ekam. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, emfa ngemɔ̃ ki eseel Tal b'ákwi-ákwi, bvool asuul bɔ mwiĩ, emfa kiki Muaan aseel wu edzii ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Ndɔɔ yinkyɛ yɛn, Tal k'atsiil ndɔɔ a mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ owi otsiil b'ãndɔɔ bueel me Muaan. <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />M'emfa okyɛ, bueel alweel Muaan, onge b'elweel bɔ Tal. Wɛn k'alweel Muaan wɛ, k'alweel Tal wu ayuɔɔl ndɛ hɛ̃ wɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />«Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mbuul wu ayoo eyɛɛn e mɛ̃, wu alɔ okiool onse wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃, oli y'elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. Ndɛ k'àbɔɔ etumbu wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ ombal k'epfu, obwel k'elaã. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, lio èyeya, lɔ emeeya meba, lɛn b'ákwi-ákwi akieel ayoo nkii a Muaan a Nziã, b'akieel ayoo yɔ akieel akal y'elaã. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Taa-taa bam, m'emfa kyɛn Tal oli y'elaã me ndyam, emfa kiki hɛ̃ ndɛ osi kwɛn Muaan akal y'elaã me ndyam. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Ndɛ hɛ̃ owi ndɛ omfam b'atsiil ãndɔɔ ã baal, me ndɔɔ yi eli ndɛ Muaan a mbuul. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Ebee okam me ndɔɔ oyɔ, ke ngwel wɛ lio èyeya lɛn bueel b'ali onse ãmpiɛɛn akieel ayoo nkii a ndɛ, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />bvool akieel apal: B'ási obvɛ akieel asiool me ndɔɔ elaã, b'ási obi akieel asiool me ndɔɔ etumbu. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Mɛ̃ bam ke nkoo k'esa ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ me myam wɛ, Mɛ̃ etsiil ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki eyoo mɛ̃. Mɛ̃ etsiil ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki dzu. Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ k'esa b'edzii mɛ̃ wɛ, mɛ̃ esa b'edzii wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃.»<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otsweel b'atsweel Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />«Okɛɛn mɛ̃ ndyam wu etsweel nzuru a mɛ̃ myam, ŋɛn ãyɛɛn ã mɛ̃ k'ãli mɔ̃-a-mɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Wu atsweel mɛ̃ mbuul ɔ̃kyam. Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ kwɛn m'eyɛɛn ndɛ me mɛ̃ ãli mã taa-taa. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Byɛ baal b'eyuɔɔl antam ola Dzaã, ndɛ bu atsweel otaa-taa. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Me b'otal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ke ndi ye kɔɔ e mbuul wu atsweel mɛ̃ wɛ. Kɛn a mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn obobɔ, kwɛn byɛ ebvuul. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Dzaã áli mbunda wu akaan bvool wu anyɛɛn, kɛn a byɛ edzii k'esia mpaa m'onyɛɛn o ndɛ me lio etsi-tsiri. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Mɛ̃ ndyam ndi y'otsweel b'atsweel mɛ̃ b'onduru b'etsweel Dzaã. Ke ngwel wɛ, Ɛ̃sal mi etam Taal mɛ̃ osa, ɛ̃sal myam mi ebesa mɛ̃, myɛ̃ ɛ̃tsweel mɛ̃. Myɛ̃ ɛ̃suo kwɛn Taal mbuul wu atam mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Taal ndyam wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃ otsweel mɛ̃. Byɛ lɔɔ-okal kɛn eyoo nkii a ndɛ wɛ, byɛ hɛ̃ kɛn emwɛn osu o ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Endɔɔ e ndɛ k'eli onse byɛ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ byɛ k'ekiool wu eyuɔɔl ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Byɛ ebebwɛɛl m'ákel, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ bam etsam wɛn, onse mɔ̃ byɛ ol'ebɔɔ elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. Kwɛn ŋɛn m'ákel omɔ̃ m'ãtsweel mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Kɛn a byɛ k'edzii k'eya ola mɛ̃ wɛ, m'obɔɔ b'elaã. <verse eid="JHN 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Mɛ̃ k'ebii lweel li efa ola baal wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ byɛ: Dzii e Nziã k'eli onse byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Mɛ̃ ndyam ngyi me nkuũ a Tal a mɛ̃, kɛn a byɛ k'eyɔɔ mɛ̃ wɛ. Ŋɛn mbuul ɔ̃kyam oyi me nkuũ a ndyam, ndɛ ondɛ wu eyɔɔ byɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Emfa emã kyɛn byɛ ol'ekiool, byɛ b'ebebii lweel onse byam-a-byam, bvool bɛn k'ebii lweel li efa ola Nziã ndyam wɛ? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Ebee otsam wɛn mɛ̃ mbuul wu efɛn byɛ ola Taal, wu afɛn byɛ Moyize, ndɛ wu eti byɛ kaã me ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ al'okɛɛn ekiool Moyize, byɛ ekeekiool mɛ̃ hɛ̃. Nzal-a-ŋɛn, ndɛ wu Moyize me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ ákel. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Kɛn onge bɛn byɛ k'ekiool m'ékel ndɛ wɛ, byɛ ãyɛɛn ã mɛ̃ bwɛn-a-bwɛn ekiool mɔ̃?»<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso oliil baal amiil ataan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oyɛn ongwel a baã li Ngalile, li ata hɛ̃ me Tibeliade. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Embuul e baal ékeluɛɛn a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ákemwɛn emvieel bvi ékesa ndɛ m'anga-ãluu. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yeso okam nkio. Oŋɔ̃, ndɛ obvi nsɛn y'ayio. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, pfuun li Onduru al'eyii tsotsoo. Olɔ pfuun li Ayuda. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Ŋ'eseel Yeso mviil, ndɛ omwɛn embuul e baal eyeya ola ndɛ. Ndɛ bu alieel Filipe ndiri: «Bia-byɛ amampa kwɛn èsuun bɔ, kwɛn baal ba abɔɔ ki-odza?» <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Ndɛ ákeyɛɛn obobɔ me ndɔɔ yi akie ɔ̃kwal a Filipe, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ ndyam ál'ayɛɛ b'ékeesa ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipe obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Onkyam ŋ'esuun amampa ba nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃nkam mviaal (200), bɔ olɔ k'akoo kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul abɔɔ etsu-tswel wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Andele wu muaan-ngoo a Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl, ngɔmɔ̃ onse ayio a ndɛ, olieel ndɛ bubu: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />«Nsam a bɔɔl ngɔmɔ̃ oli y'amampa ataan ba ɔɔdze y'answi buaal. Bɔ ol'akoo m'ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal wu?» <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yeso olieel bubu: «Emviaal baal nsɛn.» Bviĩ éli bvam bibi ke mboo oyɔ. Bɔ bu abvi nsɛn, abɔɔl nku-a-nku amiil ataan. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yeso owel amampa, obveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn, bu akab baal b'áli oŋɔ̃. Ndɛ hɛ̃ okab bɔ answi, m'emfa ki édzii baal. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ŋ'eyool baal, Yeso olieel ayio a ndɛ ndiri: «Etwal etswel bvi esiil, kwɛn eluɔ si-ngemɔ ebee nkel oyi.» <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Bɔ atwel bvɛ, bu aluul etsaka kuun ye bviaal m'etswel bvi amampa ataan ba ɔɔdze, b'ésiil baal b'ádzi. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Ŋ'emwɛn baal emvieel bvi ési ndɛ, bɔ ayɛɛn ndiri: «Mbuul wu bam oli ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã wu aya onse ɔ̃kiri.» <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Onge bɛn Yeso áyɛɛ kwɛn baal ákeya ndɛ owal m'ãnkɔɔl m'osuul o ndɛ ɔ̃kwɛn, ndɛ bvool odzuru nzuru, oyɛn nkal nkio ndyam sii.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso odzuu nkal ãdza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />M'ãnkunkwal, ayio a ndɛ akwɛɛn tiil ke baã. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Bɔ asam onse ebɛɛ, me ndɔɔ yi ayi Kapelanahum, ongwel a baã. Empeel al'emeebva. Yeso ale kɛn ayi ola bɔ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Mfel wa kokɔ oyii abop, epoo bu ebvi opɔɔn me baã. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Ke mbee a ŋɛn ayio al'amaadzoo nkɛɛ akilometele ataan wuo asɛɛn, bɔ ataal Yeso abedzuu nkal ãdza, bvool abesyal tsotsoo ebɛɛ: Bɔ ayoo buɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Kɛn a ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Eli mɛ̃, ebee buɔ oyoo!» <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Ŋ'eyii ebii k'eswɛɛl bɔ ndɛ onse ebɛɛ, kyɛ esiɛɛn ke mboo yi ékeyi bɔ.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Embuul ebii Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Ela esiool, embuul e baal b'ásiil ongwel a baã, amwɛn kwɛn ebɛɛ éli kɛn a ngemɔ̃ oŋɔ̃, Yeso k'ásam onse kyɛ y'ayio wɛ, bɔ ayɛn bam sii. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Kɛn ebɛɛ bvikyɛ efi Tibeliade, tsotsoo a mboo yi édzi bɔ mampa, ke mbee a ŋ'ébveel Mfam ãtuɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Ŋ'emwɛn embuul kwɛn, ekal Yeso, ekal ayio a ndɛ, wu áli oŋɔ̃ pyɛ, baal asam me bam onse ebɛɛ obvɛ, bu ayi Kapelanahum, m'obii o Yeso.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso, mampa wa ywel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Bɔ amwɛn Yeso ongwel a baã, bu afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Rabbi, yɛ ŋã mpuanki yi?» <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn byɛ ebii mɛ̃, ke me ndɔɔ yi emwɛn byɛ emvieel wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ edzi amampa bvool eyool. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Ebee osal me ndɔɔ a bvi-odza bvi ebii, esal me ndɔɔ a bvi-odza bvi eyiil bvool ewa elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu, bvi ekieel ewa Muaan a mbuul byɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã wu Taal osi ndɛ eliĩ ki omfam o ndɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Bɔ alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Bee emã esa m'osa b'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ Nziã?» <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Ɔ̃sal a Nziã ŋ'elɔ byɛ okiool onse wu eyuɔɔl ndyam.» <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Bɔ bu abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Obobɔ, emvieel emã kyɛn yɛ ndyam asa, kwɛn bee emwɛn bvool ekiool yɛ? Ki èsa yɛ emã? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ ádzi mane onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ, onge b'ákel ndiri: “Ndɛ áwi bɔ mampa wu ofi ywel.”» <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yeso olieel bɔ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eliaal byɛ wɛn, wu áwi byɛ mampa wa ywel ke Moyize wɛ, Tal a mɛ̃ wu awa byɛ mampa wa ywel wa taa-taa. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mampa a Nziã, eli wu ofi ywel m'owa b'ɔ̃kiri elaã.» <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Bɔ ayɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee, wa bee mampa ondɛ ãlio mbueel.»<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yeso olieel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ bam ndi mampa wu elaã. Wu aya ola mɛ̃ k'ayoo nzal bam wɛ, bvool wu alɔ okiool onse mɛ̃ k'ayoo nzuaal yam wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ elieel byɛ yɔ: Byɛ emwɛn mɛ̃, byɛ k'ekiool mɛ̃ wɛ! <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Baal bueel b'ewi Taal mɛ̃ àya ola mɛ̃. Mbuul wu aya ola mɛ̃, mɛ̃ k'ètswɛɛl ndɛ bam wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ mfi ywel, ke m'osa o b'edzii mɛ̃ wɛ, m'osa o b'edzii wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Kɛn a b'edzii wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃ bɛn, mɛ̃ mbee mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ onse b'ewi ndɛ mɛ̃ odzeel, kɛn a mɛ̃ èseel ndɛ me tsoo e ntɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Ngwanyã, b'edzii tal a mɛ̃ bɛn, mbuul wueel wu omwɛn Muaan, bvool olɔ okiool onse ndɛ, akal y'elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu, bvool mɛ̃, mɛ̃ èseel ndɛ me tsoo e ntɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Ayuda ákeŋwaã me ndɔɔ a Yeso ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ áyɛɛn ndiri: «Mɛ̃ wu ndi mampa wu ofi ywel.» <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Bɔ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Wu ke Yeso wu muaan a Dzedzef wu eyɛɛ bia-byɛ tal ye ngoo wɛ? Bɛn meba ndɛ atɔ m'oyɛɛn ndiri: “Mɛ̃ mfi ywel!”» <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Ebee obeŋwaã byam-a-byam! <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Mbuul k'akoo m'oya ola mɛ̃ wɛ, okɛɛn Taal wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃ k'adzuru ndɛ wɛ, bvool mɛ̃, mɛ̃ èseel ndɛ me tsoo e ntɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Ákel onse ɛ̃nkaan mi aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ndiri: “Nziã akieel ayiool bɔ bueel.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Edz 54.13</ref></char></note> Mbuul ɔ̃bi pyɛ wu oyoo Taal bvool oyɔɔ m'eyiool ndɛ, aya ola mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Oŋɔ̃ ke ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri mbuul omwɛn Taal wɛ. Wu omwɛn Taal, kɛn a wu ofi ola Nziã. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mbuul wu okiool oli y'elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Mɛ̃ wu ndi mampa wu awa elaã. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Ankiɔɔn a byɛ ádzi mane onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ, kɛn a bɔ ámaakwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Kɛn a mampa wu, wu ofi ywel, wu adza ndɛ, k'àkwa wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Mɛ̃ wu ndi mampa wu omwiĩ wu ofi ywel. Mbuul wu adza mampa ondɛ, ndɛ akieel akal y'elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. Mampa wu èwa mɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yɛn ɔ̃kiri akal y'elaã, eli nzuru a mɛ̃.»<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Tsuun-a-tsuun bu abvi onse Ayuda bam-a-bam ndiri: «Ndɔɔ mã yi ewa ngaburu wu bia-byɛ nzuru a ndɛ odza?» <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yeso olieel bɔ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, okɛɛn byɛ k'edzi nzuru a Muaan a mbuul wɛ, okɛɛn byɛ hɛ̃ k'enywi ãkel ã ndɛ wɛ, ŋɛn byɛ k'ekal y'elaã wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Wu adza nzuru a mɛ̃, bvool anywã ãkel ã mɛ̃ oli y'elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu, bvool mɛ̃, mɛ̃ èseel ndɛ me tsoo e ntɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Ke ngwel wɛ, nzuru a mɛ̃ eli bvi-odza bvi ngwanyã, ãkel ã mɛ̃ ãli eluɔ ki ngwanyã ki anywã. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Mbuul wu adza nzuru a mɛ̃, bvool anywã ãkel ã mɛ̃, akal onse mɛ̃, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ekal onse ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Emfa ngemɔ̃ kyɛn Taal wu oli mwiĩ oyuɔɔl mɛ̃, bvool kyɛn mɛ̃ ndi y'elaã me nkuul a ndɛ, emfa kiki hɛ̃ mbuul wu adza mɛ̃ akieel akal y'elaã me nkuul a mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Ki emfa ki eli mampa wu ofi ywel. Ndɛ k'ali onge mampa wu édzi ankɔɔ wɛ, wɛn bɔ, bɔ ákwi. Wu adza mampa wu akieel akal y'elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu.»<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Omɔ̃ ãndɔɔ m'ékeyɛɛn Yeso ŋ'ékeyiool ndɛ onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn a Ayuda ke Kapelanahum.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãyɛɛn m'elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ŋ'eyoo ayio a ndɛ bibi ãyɛɛn ã ndɛ, bɔ ayɛɛn ndiri: «Oyɛɛn obɔ oli ye mpuru! Wɛn ol'okiool bɔ nã?» <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Ŋ'eyɛɛ Yeso kwɛn ayio a ndɛ ákeŋwaã me ndɔɔ oyɔ, ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Oyɛɛn obɔ obii byɛ ɛ̃kwal? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Ke ŋ'emwɛn byɛ Muaan a mbuul anɔɔn ke mboo yi éli ndɛ tsɔɔn? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Wu awa elaã, eli Ɔ̃fel. Nzuru k'eli y'otsɛn wɛ. Ãyɛɛn mɛn mɛ̃ ndyam ngyɛɛn mɛ̃ byɛ ãfi ol'Ɔ̃fel, bvool mɔ̃ ãwa elaã. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Kɛn a baal bakyɛ onse byɛ k'akiool wɛ.» Ke ngwel wɛ, fa obɛɛn, Yeso áyɛɛ bɛn k'akaakiool wɛ, ye wu atiɔ ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Ndɛ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Obɔ otsɛn b'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ byɛ wɛn, mbuul k'akoo m'oya ola mɛ̃ wɛ, okɛɛn Taal k'awi ndɛ nkuul wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 6:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Me lio olɔ, ayio a ndɛ bibi ayiri ndɛ, k'abedzuu ye ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yeso bu alieel antam kuun ye buaal bubu: «Ke byɛ, byɛ hɛ̃ edzii k'eyi?» <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, bee ola nã èyi? Yɛ li y'ãyɛɛn m'ãwa elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Bee, bee bam ekiool bvool eyɛɛ wɛn yɛ li mbuul wu Ɔ̃nsensal wu ofi ola Nziã.» <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Wu osueel byɛ, byɛ ange-kuun ye buaal, ke mɛ̃ wɛ? Kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ oli Ɔ̃pfu.» <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Ndɛ ákeyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a Yuda wu muaan a Simɔ̃ Isikaliot. Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ wu átiɔ ndɛ. Ndɛ wu Yuda áli ngɔmɔ̃ onse antam ange-nkuun ye buaal.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Baan-ngoo a Yeso k'akiool ndɛ wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso ákenɔɔn k'adziɔɔn Ngalile. Ndɛ k'ákedzii k'adzuu onse Yude wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn Ayuda ákebii ndɛ obam. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, pfuun li Ayuda li ãnzɔ m'ebaan bvi anyam al'eyii tsotsoo. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Baan-ngoo a Yeso alieel ndɛ bubu: «Mbal ke nsie yi, yi Yude, kwɛn ayio a yɛ hɛ̃ amwɛn ɛ̃sal mi esa yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Mbuul wu odzii kwɛn baal ayɛɛ ndɛ, k'asa ãndɔɔ m'edziɔɔn wɛ. Onge bɛn yɛ abesa ãndɔɔ m'emfa okyɛ, pal ke nkwel a baal, kwɛn baal bueel amwɛn yɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ɔ̃nkyam baan-ngoo a Yeso k'ákelɔ okiool onse ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Lio li mɛ̃ kɛn ekoo wɛ, kɛn a li byɛ eli kɛn oli. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Ɔ̃kiri k'akoo m'obyal o byɛ wɛ, kɛn a mɛ̃, ndɛ abyal mɛ̃, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ebesuo kal-a-kal wɛn, ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ ɛ̃li ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Eyi byɛ pfuun. Me b'otal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ke lɔ eyi wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ lio e mɛ̃ kɛn ekoo wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Ŋ'eman Yeso ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ oyɛɛn, ndɛ osiil li ndyam ke Ngalile.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso ke pfuun li ãnzɔ m'ebaan bvi anyam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Kɛn a ŋ'eyɛn baan-ngoo a ndɛ pfuun, ndɛ hɛ̃ oyɛn okɔ. Ndɛ k'asuo baal nzuru wɛ, oyɛn m'edziɔɔn. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Ayuda ákebii ndɛ onse pfuun, bvool ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Ngaburu wu ndyam kwɛn ali?» <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Onse embuul, ákenyiin me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. Bɛn ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Ndɛ mbuul wu ɔ̃bvɛ.» Bɛn ndiri: «Ndɛ abepfuru baal.» <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Kɛn a mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'ákeyɛɛn kal-a-kal me ndɔɔ a ndɛ wɛ, me buɔ b'amfam b'Ayuda. <verse eid="JHN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ŋ'eyii ãtsoo ã pfuun ekal-a-kal, Yeso oyɛn onse Nzɔ a Nziã, bu abvi oyiool. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Ayuda ɛ̃kam ɛ̃si bɔ, bvool afuul bam-a-bam ndiri: «Ndɛ ekɔɔl k'ási wɛ, ke ndɛ m'ákel bwɛn-a-bwɛn ayɛɛ mɔ̃?» <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «M'eyiool mɛ̃ k'ãfi ola myam wɛ, mɔ̃ ãfi ola wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Okɛɛn mbuul odzii k'asa b'edzii Nziã, ndɛ ol'oyɛɛ okɛɛn m'eyiool mɛ̃ ãfi ola Nziã, wuo okɛɛn mɛ̃ eyɛɛn me myam. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Mbuul wu ayɛɛn me ndyam abii lweel e ndyam. Kɛn a wu abii lweel e wu atam ndɛ oli mbuul wa taa-taa, pfuru k'eli onse ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Moyize owi byɛ Ngel, kɛn a byɛ k'esa m'etam yɔ byɛ osa wɛ! Ke ki ebii byɛ mɛ̃ obam emã?» <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Embuul obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ mpii y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi li! Wu abii yɛ obam nã?» <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ nsi kɛn a ɔ̃sal ngɔmɔ̃, byɛ bueel ekam bibi. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Moyize átam byɛ k'etsiil baan. Ke yam, ndɔɔ oyɔ k'éfi ola ndɛ wɛ, yɔ éfi ol'ankɔɔ. Byɛ ebetsiil baan onkyam me tsoo e saba. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Byɛ ebetsiil baan me tsoo e saba, m'okiaal o ngel a Moyize. Ke ki eyoo byɛ nkyee ye mɛ̃ emã, mɛ̃ wu nsuul mbuul nzuru yueel kɛɛ-kɛɛ me saba. <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Ebee ãndɔɔ otsiil me m'emwɛn byɛ me mviil, etsiil ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki dzu!»<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso Mãsia ali?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Baal a Yelusalem bakyɛ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Wu ke mbuul wu ebebii bɔ obam wɛ? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Tal ndɛ bu ayii ayɛɛn kal-a-kal bu, bɛn bɔ yi ayɛɛn ndɛ pyɛ! Amfam amaabɔɔ otsɛn bam kwɛn ndɛ oli Mãsia? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Ndɛ wu, bia-byɛ eyɛɛ ku efi ndɛ! Kɛn a Mãsia, ŋ'èya ndɛ, mbuul k'ayɛɛ ku efi ndɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Obobɔ, Yeso wu ákeyiool onse Nzɔ a Nziã, obiool ndiri: «Byɛ eyɛɛ mɛ̃, byɛ hɛ̃ eyɛɛ ku mfi mɛ̃. Kɛn a mɛ̃ ke ngyi me nkuũ a myam wɛ. Wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃, oli wa taa-taa. Kɛn a byɛ, byɛ k'eyɛɛ ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ mfi ola ndɛ, bvool ndɛ wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃.» <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />M'emfa okyɛ, bɔ ákebii k'asiin ndɛ, kɛn a wu ondɔɔl kuɔɔl nkal a ndɛ pyɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn lio e ndɛ ale kɛn ekoo wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Onse embuul, baal bibi alɔ okiool onse ndɛ. Bɔ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Mãsia, ŋ'èya ndɛ kieel ol'osi emvieel bvi enduru bvi mbuul wu?»<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atam Yeso osiin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Afalisaye ayoo embuul enyiin me ndɔɔ a Yeso. Obobɔ, angaa-a-Nziã b'anɛn y'afalisaye atam ankiaal a Nzɔ a Nziã k'asiin ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Ndɛ olieel bubu: «Mɛ̃ kɛn ndi y'eli-lio yɛ byɛ, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ mɛ̃ èbvool ola wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Byɛ ekieel ebii mɛ̃, kɛn a byɛ kieel k'ebɔɔ mɛ̃ wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, mboo yi ndi mɛ̃, byɛ, byɛ k'ekoo m'oya wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Ayuda ayɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Ndɛ kwɛn àyi, kwɛn bia-byɛ bvool ebee ndɛ obemwɛn? Ndɛ àyi ola b'átsɔɔn-átsɔɔn onse Agelek, bvool ayeyiool Agelek? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Ndɛ oyɛɛn ndiri: “Byɛ ekieel ebii mɛ̃, byɛ kieel k'ebɔɔ mɛ̃ wɛ. Mboo yi ndi mɛ̃, byɛ k'ekoo m'oya wɛ”.» Oŋɔ̃ ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri nki?<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãnzal m'elaã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Me tsoo e ntɔ, tsoo li nɛn li pfuun, Yeso tɛ m'ɔ̃kiri, obiool ndiri: «Okɛɛn mbuul oli ye nzuaal, yɔɔl ndɛ aya ola mɛ̃, bvool anywã! <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Mbuul wu olɔ okiool onse mɛ̃, ãnzal m'elaã ãkyal fa mwiĩ a ndɛ, onge b'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Ezk 47.1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:8">Dzã 14.8</ref> </char></note>» <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />M'ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, Yeso ŋ'ákeyɛɛn me ndɔɔ Ɔ̃fel wu ekieel eyɔɔ b'akieel alɔ okiool onse ndɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, Ɔ̃fel ale kɛn ayi wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ale kɛn andɛɛl Yeso onse lweel wɛ.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baal akab nzuru me ndɔɔ a Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Onse embuul, baal bibi b'áyoo ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, ayɛɛn ndiri: «Mbuul wu bam oli ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã!» <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Bakyɛ ayɛɛn ndiri: «Ndɛ oli Mãsia!» Bakyɛ bvool ayɛɛn ndiri: «Mãsia Ngalile àfa? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ayɛɛn ndiri Mãsia àkal ɔ̃tiɔɔl a David, àfa Betelem, ola b'éli David, k'obobɔ wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2Sa 7.12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:1">Mis 5.1</ref></char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />M'emfa okyɛ, onse embuul baal akab nzuru me ndɔɔ a Yeso. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bakyɛ onse bɔ ákedzii k'asiin Yeso, kɛn a mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'andɔɔl kuɔɔl nkal a ndɛ wɛ.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃kwal mpɛn wu amfam b'Ayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Ankiaal ayebvool ol'angaa-a-Nziã b'anɛn y'afalisaye. Bɔ afuul ankiaal bubu: «Kyɛn byɛ k'eyi ye ndɛ wɛ emã?» <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Ankiaal abveel ndiri: «Lɔɔ-okal mbuul kɛn ayɛɛn onge ndɛ wɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Afalisaye abveel bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ, ewi nzuru apfuru byɛ hɛ̃? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Onse amfam wuo onse afalisaye, eli ye mbuul wu olɔ okiool onse ndɛ? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Kɛn embuul kyɛn k'eyɛɛ Ngel wɛ ki, ábwel kyɛ enkɛɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodem wɛn tsɔɔn áyemwɛɛn ye Yeso, bvool wu áli ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ, olieel bɔ bubu: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />«Ngel a bia-byɛ ewa bia-byɛ nkuul yi ewa mbuul etumbu, tsɔɔn k'eyoo ndɛ wɛ, k'eyɛɛ hɛ̃ m'esa ndɛ wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ hɛ̃ ɔ̃fi-Ngalile li? Bwɛɛl m'ákel, yɛ olɔ mwɛn kwɛn k'eli y'ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã si ngɔmɔ̃ wu afa Ngalile wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />[Obobɔ, mbuul bwɛn a mbuul oyɛn nzɔ a ndyam.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃kaal wu asiin y'anga-ɔ̃lam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Yeso oyɛn nkio yi Olibve. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Kɛn a m'epal-epal, ndɛ obvool Nzɔ a Nziã, baal bueel ayi ola ndɛ. Ŋ'ebvi ndɛ nsɛn, ndɛ obvi bɔ oyiool. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Ayiool b'ãngel y'afalisaye abiri ndɛ ɔ̃kaal wu adzwɛɛn ye bɔɔl. Bɔ asuul ndɛ kal-a-kal a embuul. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Bɔ alieel Yeso bubu: «Ɔ̃tee, ɔ̃kaal wu, adzwɛɛn ndɛ ye bɔɔl. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Onse Ngel, Moyize atam bee k'etyal akaal ba m'emfa ki ãnkɔɔn.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20.10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Det 22.22-24</ref></char></note> Obobɔ, yi eyɛɛn yɛ mã?» <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Bɔ ákeyɛɛn obobɔ, m'ombio o ndɛ, kwɛn bɔ abɔɔ elyal ki afɛn ndɛ. Kɛn a ŋ'epfɔɔn ndɛ, ndɛ obvi okel me nsie m'ɔ̃liɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Onge bɛn bɔ ákefuul ndɛ ɛ̃mfuul kɛn ofuul, ndɛ oseel nzuru, olieel bɔ ndiri: «Yɔɔl kwɛn onse byɛ, mbuul wu oywɛn obi, akal mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel wu atyal ndɛ nkɔɔn!» <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Ndɛ opfɔɔn bvool, bu abvi okel bvool me nsie. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Ŋ'eyoo bɔ ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, bɔ adzuru ãnzuru ngɔmɔ̃-ngɔmɔ̃, bɛɛn m'akuul. Yeso osiil ndyam y'ɔ̃kaal wu áli kal-a-kal a baal. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Obobɔ, Yeso oseel nzuru, olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Ke ngu, bɔ kwɛn ali? Mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'awi yɛ etumbu wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Ɔ̃kaal obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mbuul pyɛ, taal.» Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ke ngwi yɛ etumbu wɛ. Oŋɔ̃ yi, bee bvool obi obesa.»]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi, k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaal mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwiĩ a ɔ̃kiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yeso bvool olieel bɔ bubu: «Mɛ̃ bam ndi mwiĩ a ɔ̃kiri. Mbuul wu anɔɔn a mɛ̃, k'àdzuu onse empeel bam wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ àkal ye mwiĩ wu elaã.» <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Obobɔ, afalisaye alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ ndyam atsweel nzuru a yɛ yam: Ŋɛn otsweel o nzuru obɔ k'oli bo taa-taa wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Onkyam ŋɛn mɛ̃ etsweel nzuru a mɛ̃ myam, otsweel o nzuru o mɛ̃ oli bo taa-taa, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ku mfi mɛ̃ ye ku eyi mɛ̃. Byɛ, byɛ k'eyɛɛ ku mfi mɛ̃ wɛ, k'eyɛɛ hɛ̃ ku eyi mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Byɛ, byɛ etsiil ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki ombuul, kɛn a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ k'ewa mbuul etumbu wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Okɛɛn mɛ̃ ndyam ekeewa mbuul etumbu, etumbu e mɛ̃ ekeekal ki taa-taa, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ke ndi myam sii wɛ: Mɛ̃ ndi ye Taal wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Ákel onse Ngel a byɛ ndiri m'etsweel baal buaal ãli taa-taa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Det 19.15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ebetsweel nzuru a mɛ̃ myam, Taal wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃ abetsweel mɛ̃ hɛ̃.» <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Bɔ bu afuul Yeso ndiri: «Tal a yɛ oli kwɛn?» Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ k'eyɛɛ mɛ̃ wɛ, byɛ hɛ̃ k'eyɛɛ Tal a mɛ̃ wɛ. Okɛɛn byɛ al'eyɛɛ mɛ̃, byɛ ekeeyɛɛ Tal a mɛ̃ hɛ̃.»<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Ndɛ ákeyɛɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ŋ'ékeyiool ndɛ onse Nzɔ a Nziã, tsotsoo eluɔ ki abelɔ ãkab mã nzi. Mbuul k'asiin ndɛ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ lio e ndɛ ale kɛn ekoo wɛ.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wu eyuɔɔl Tal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yeso bvool olieel bɔ bubu: «Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ eyi, byɛ èbii mɛ̃, bvool byɛ èkwa onse obi o byɛ. Ku eyi mɛ̃ ndyam, byɛ, byɛ k'ekoo m'oya okɔ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Ayuda ayɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Ndɛ nzuru abii obam, kwɛn ndɛ ayɛɛn ndiri: “Ku eyi mɛ̃, byɛ bam k'ekoo m'oya okɔ wɛ.”» <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yeso ákeyɛɛn bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ, byɛ eli ba nsie, mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi wa ywel. Byɛ, byɛ eli b'ɔ̃kiri wu, mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ke ndi wu ɔ̃kiri wu wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Obɔ otsɛn be ngyɛɛn mɛ̃ wɛn, byɛ èkwa onse ãbi ã byɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋɛn byɛ k'ekiool wɛ wɛn, mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi, byɛ èkwa onse ãbi ã byɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Bɔ ákeliaal ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ, yɛ ndyam nã li?» Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Wu ngyɛɛn mɛ̃ byɛ fa obɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Mɛ̃ ndi y'ãndɔɔ bibi me ndɔɔ a byɛ m'eyɛɛn ye m'etsiil. Kɛn a wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃ oli wa taa-taa, bvool mɛ̃ ndyam eliaal ɔ̃kiri me ngyoo mɛ̃ ola ndɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Bɔ k'akwaal otsɛn ndiri ndɛ ákeyɛɛn ye bɔ me ndɔɔ a Tal wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Yeso olieel bɔ ndiri: «Ŋ'ekieel endɛɛl byɛ Muaan a mbuul, byɛ ekieel eyɛɛ wɛn mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi, bvool wɛn mɛ̃ k'esa ndɔɔ me myam wɛ. Kɛn a mɛ̃ eyɛɛn m'emfa ki eyiool Taal mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃ oli ye mɛ̃. Ndɛ k'asuul mɛ̃ myam-sii wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ndyam ebesa ãlio mbueel b'edzii ndɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Onge bɛn ákeyɛɛn ndɛ obobɔ, baal bibi alɔ okiool onse ndɛ.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baan b'Abalayam wuo baan b'ɔ̃fpu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yeso olieel Ayuda b'álɔ okiool onse ndɛ ndiri: «Okɛɛn byɛ ekuru nzuru me be ngyɛɛn mɛ̃, byɛ bam ŋ'eli ayio a mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Byɛ ekieel eyɛɛ otaa-taa, otaa-taa okieel osuul byɛ ndii.» <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ bubu: «Bee eli atiɔɔl b'Abalayam, bee mwɛn-éndɛɛl kɛn ekal ankyal a mbuul wɛ, bɛn yɛ ndyam atɔ m'oyɛɛn wɛn: “Byɛ ekieel ekal ndii!”» <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mbuul wueel wu asa obi, oli ɔ̃nkyal a obi. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Ɔ̃nkyal k'akal onse nzɔ ɔ̃bu wɛ, kɛn a muaan wu akal onse yɔ ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />M'emfa okyɛ, okɛɛn Muaan osuul byɛ ndii, byɛ ekieel ekal bam ndii. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ wɛn, byɛ eli atiɔɔl b'Abalayam. Kɛn a byɛ ebii k'ebam mɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yɛn eyɛɛn e mɛ̃ k'ebɔɔ mboo onse byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn me mwɛn mɛ̃ ola Taal, oŋɔ̃ byɛ hɛ̃, esa m'eyoo byɛ ola tal wa byɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Tal a bee, eli Abalayam.» Ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Okɛɛn byɛ eli baan b'Abalayam, kɛn byɛ ekeesa ɛ̃sal mi Abalayam. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Kɛn a meba, byɛ ebebii mɛ̃ wu ebam, mɛ̃ mbuul wu ngyɛɛn byɛ otaa-taa be ngyoo mɛ̃ ola Nziã. Abalayam k'ási obobɔ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Byɛ, byɛ esa ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ tal a byɛ.» Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Bee, bee k'eli baan b'embwɔɔ wɛ, bee eli kɛn a me tal ngɔmɔ̃: Tal a bee, eli Nziã.» <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yeso olieel bɔ ndiri: «Al'okɛɛn Nziã ali Tal a byɛ, byɛ ekeedzii mɛ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃, mɛ̃ mpal ola Nziã, bvool mfi ola ndɛ. Mɛ̃ ke mfi ola myam wɛ, wu otam mɛ̃ ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Ndɔɔ mã yɛn byɛ k'ekwaal otsɛn b'eyɛɛn e mɛ̃ wɛ? Me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ k'ekoo k'eyoo ãyɛɛn ã mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Byɛ, byɛ eli baan a tal a byɛ wu Ɔ̃pfu, obobɔ, byɛ edzii k'esa b'edzii tal a byɛ. Ndɛ wu Ɔ̃pfu oli ɔ̃bam fa obɛɛn. Ndɛ k'ákekal onse otaa-taa wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn onse ndɛ otaa-taa pyɛ. Ŋ'etsoo ndɛ mfya, ndɛ ŋ'ayɛɛn m'emfa ki eli ndyam, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ oli nga-mfya, bvool oli tal a mfya. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Kɛn a mɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ eyɛɛn otaa-taa, byɛ k'ekiool mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Onse byɛ, mbuul wɛn okoo k'aliaal mɛ̃ obi be nsi mɛ̃ nã? Okɛɛn mɛ̃ eyɛɛn otaa-taa, otsɛn omã bɛn byɛ bam k'ekiool mɛ̃ wɛ? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Mbuul a Nziã akiool ãyɛɛn ã Nziã. Okɛɛn byɛ bam k'ekiool wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ k'eli ba Nziã wɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso y'Abalayam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Ayuda abveel Yeso ndiri: «Bee ke y'ɔ̃dzoo wu eyɛɛn wɛn yɛ, yɛ li ɔ̃fi-Samali, bvool wɛn yɛ li y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi wɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ke ndi y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi wɛ. Mɛ̃ elweel Tal a mɛ̃. Kɛn a byɛ, byɛ k'elweel mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ k'ebii lweel li myam wɛ, eli ye ngɔmɔ̃ wu abii lweel e mɛ̃, bvool atsiil ãndɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, okɛɛn mbuul okwee eyɛɛn e mɛ̃, ndɛ kieel k'akwa bam wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Obobɔ, Ayuda alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Meba ŋã, bee eyeyɛɛ kwɛn yɛ li y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi. Abalayam okwi, aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã hɛ̃ akwi, bɛn yɛ bam atɔ m'oyɛɛn wɛn: “okɛɛn mbuul okwee eyɛɛn e mɛ̃, ndɛ kieel k'akwa bam wɛ!” <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Yɛ bam olɔ nduru tal a bee Abalayam wu ákwi. Aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ákwi hɛ̃. Yɛ b'atsam wɛn yɛ nã li?» <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Okɛɛn mɛ̃ ebelweel nzuru a mɛ̃ myam, lweel e mɛ̃ k'eli y'otsɛn wɛ. Wu abelweel mɛ̃, Tal a mɛ̃. Ndɛ wu ebeyɛɛn byɛ wɛn: “Ndɛ oli Nziã a bee!” <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Ke yam, byɛ k'eyɛɛ ndɛ wɛ, kɛn a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ndɛ. Okɛɛn mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn wɛn, mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ ndɛ wɛ, mɛ̃ olɔ nkal nga-mfya onge byɛ. Kɛn a mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ndɛ, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ elweel Endɔɔ e ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Abalayam wu tal a byɛ áluul m'esɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ áyɛɛ kwɛn ndɛ àmwɛn tsoo e mɛ̃. Ndɛ ámwɛn lɔ, bvool ásia mpaa ngamfɛn.» <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Ayuda alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ mvel ãku-ãtaan (50) kɛn ekoo wɛ, yɛ wɛn yɛ ámwɛn Abalayam!» <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yeso olieel bɔ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ye k'aburu Abalayam, mɛ̃ ndi.» <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Etɔ oŋɔ̃, bɔ awel ãnkɔɔn, me ndɔɔ yi atyal ndɛ mɔ̃. Kɛn a Yeso odziɔɔn, bu apal onse Nzɔ a Nziã.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso oboo mbuul wu áburu mviil ɔ̃kwa-ɔ̃kwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Ŋ'eyii ebwel Yeso, ndɛ omwɛn mbuul wu áburu mviil ɔ̃kwa-ɔ̃kwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Ayio a ndɛ afuul ndɛ bubu: «Rabbi, Wu ási obi nã, ndyam wuo aburu a ndɛ, kwɛn aburu ndɛ mviil ɔ̃kwa-ɔ̃kwa?» <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Ke me ndɔɔ yɛn ndyam wuo aburu a ndɛ ási obi wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ Nziã ɛ̃mɔɔn onse ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Ŋ'ebal mwiĩ kɛn, ebvaan bia-byɛ esa ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ wu otam mɛ̃. Tsia ayebva wɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'akoo m'osa ɔ̃sal si ngɔmɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Ŋe ndi mɛ̃ onse ɔ̃kiri, mɛ̃ ndi mwiĩ a ɔ̃kiri.» <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Ke mbee a ŋ'eyɛɛn ndɛ obobɔ, ndɛ otsweel ãntɛɛ me nsie, bvool obuo pɔtɔ-pɔtɔ m'ãntɛɛ omɔ̃, okel lɔ me mviil m'ɔ̃kwa-mviil. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Ndɛ olieel ɔ̃nkwa-mviil bubu: «Yi, suɔɔl osu k'edzii e Silohe.» Nkuũ oyɔ, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri «wu atam.» Ndɛ oyɛn okɔ, osuɔɔl osu. Ŋ'ekɔɔl ndɛ, ndɛ oyii amwɛn.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Baal b'akal tsotsoo ye ndɛ ye bɛn tsɔɔn ámwɛn k'ékelaa ndɛ eluɔ, ákeyɛɛn bubu: «Wu ke mbuul wu áli me nsɛn ákelaa eluɔ wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Bɛn ndiri: «Ndɛ!» Bɛn ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, ndɛ oli y'emfa e ndɛ.» Ndyam ndiri: «Eli mɛ̃!» <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Bɔ afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Emfa emã ki edzweel mviil ã yɛ nzuru?» <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Ndɛ obveel ndiri: «Mbuul wu ata me Yeso obuo pɔtɔ-pɔtɔ, okel mɛ̃ lɔ me mviil, bu alieel mɛ̃ ndiri: “Yi, nsuɔɔl osu k'edzii e Silohe.” Mɛ̃ bu ngyɛn okɔ, nsuɔɔl osu okɔ, mɛ̃ bu ngyii emwɛn.» <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Bɔ afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Ngaburu ondɛ kwɛn ali?» Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ wɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afalisaye y'ɔ̃nkwa-mviil wu emburu-ngoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Bɔ abiri mbuul wu áli ɔ̃nkwa-mviil ol'afalisaye. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Onkyel ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, ŋ'ébuo Yeso pɔtɔ-pɔtɔ, bvool ádzweel ndɛ mviil, éli tsoo e saba. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Obobɔ, afalisaye hɛ̃ afuul ndɛ emfa ki émwɛn ndɛ bvool. Ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Ndɛ okel mɛ̃ pɔtɔ-pɔtɔ me mviil, mɛ̃ nsuɔɔl osu, mɛ̃ bu ngyii emwɛn.» <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />M'emfa okyɛ, afalisaye bakyɛ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Mbuul wu k'ali wa Nziã wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ k'akiaal saba wɛ.» Bakyɛ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Emfa emã kyɛn nga-ãbi okoo k'asa emvieel bvi bubu?» Obobɔ, okab osam onse bɔ. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Bɔ bvool afuul ɔ̃nkwa-mviil bubu: «Ke yɛ, yɛ yɛɛn ndiri nki me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, onge bɛn ndɛ odzweel yɛ mviil?» Ndɛ obveel ndiri: «Ndɛ oli ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã.» <verse eid="JHN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Ayuda k'akiool kwɛn ndɛ áli ɔ̃nkwa-mviil wɛ, bvool kwɛn ndɛ ábvi omwɛn bvool. Bɔ bu ati aburu a ndɛ mbel. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Bɔ afuul bɔ ndiri: «Ondɛ muaan a byɛ, wɛn byɛ, byɛ ebeyɛɛn wɛn áburu ndɛ mviil ɔ̃kwa-ɔ̃kwa? Emfa emã ki eyii emwɛn ndɛ meba?» <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Aburu a ndɛ abveel bubu: «Bee eyɛɛ kwɛn ndɛ oli muaan a bee, bvool kwɛn áburu ndɛ mviil ɔ̃kwa-ɔ̃kwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Kɛn a me b'otal emfa ki oboomwɛn ndɛ meba, bee k'eyɛɛ wɛ. Wu odzweel ndɛ mviil nã? Bee bam k'eyɛɛ wɛ. Efuul ndɛ, ndɛ oyii mange-mbuul, ndɛ okoo m'oyɛɛn ãndɔɔ m'ãtal ndyam.» <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Bɔ ayɛɛn obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ákebal Ayuda, ke ngwel wɛ Ayuda ál'amaakuru ndiri mbuul wu akiool ndiri Yeso oli Mãsia, àtswɛɛl ndɛ onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Obɔ otsɛn b'elieel aburu a ndɛ ndiri: «Efuul ndyam, ndɛ oyii mange-mbuul.» <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Afalisaye ati mbuul wu áli ɔ̃kwa-mviil mbel li nsa yuaal, bu alieel bubu: «Lweel Nziã. Bee bam eyɛɛ wɛn mbuul ondɛ oli nga-ãbi.» <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Ndɛ obveel ndiri: «Okɛɛn ndɛ oli nga-ãbi, mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ wɛ, ki ngyɛɛ mɛ̃ kyɛn mɛ̃ éli ɔ̃nkwa-mviil, meba mɛ̃ ngyii emwɛn.» <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Bɔ afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Ndɛ yɛ emã asi? Ndɛ yɛ mviil bwɛn-a-bwɛn azweel mɔ̃?» <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ emeeyɛɛn byɛ yɔ, byɛ k'eyoo wɛ. Otsɛn omã b'edzii byɛ k'eyoo yɔ bvool? Byɛ bam edzii k'ekɔɔl ayio a ndɛ hɛ̃?» <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Bɔ atoo ndɛ, bvool ayɛɛn ndiri: «Wu oli ɔ̃yio a ngaburu ondɛ mpii yɛ, bee, bee ayio a Moyize eli. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Bee bam eyɛɛ wɛn Nziã áyɛɛn ye Moyize, ke ngaburu wu, bee k'eyɛɛ ku efi ndɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Mbuul ondɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Oyɔ ndɔɔ yam yi ɛ̃kam, yɛn byɛ, byɛ k'eyɛɛ ku efi ndɛ wɛ, kwɛn ŋɛn ndɛ odzweel mɛ̃ mviil. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Bia-byɛ eyɛɛ kwɛn Nziã k'ayoo baal b'ãbi wɛ. Kɛn a wu alweel ndɛ, bvool asa b'edzii ndɛ, ndɛ ondɛ, ndɛ ayoo ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Lɔɔ-okal, bia-byɛ kɛn eyoo ndiri mbuul odzweel ɔ̃nkwa-mviil wu emburu-ngoo mviil wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Okɛɛn mbuul wu k'afi ola Nziã wɛ, ndɛ olɔ k'akoo k'asa ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ, aburu yɛ ndyam wueel onse obi, yɛ wu ayiool bee!» Bɔ bu atswɛɛl ndɛ onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yeso oyoo ndiri bɔ atswɛɛl ndɛ. Ndɛ oyebɔɔ ndɛ, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ, yɛ lɔ okiool onse Muaan a mbuul?» <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Ndɛ obveel Yeso ndiri: «Taal, ndɛ nã, kwɛn mɛ̃ ndɔ okiool onse ndɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ mwɛn ndɛ, wu abeyɛɛn ye yɛ wu, eli ndɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Obobɔ, ndɛ oyɛɛn ndiri: «Mɛ̃ nkiool, Mfam.» Ndɛ bu abvi ãbuo ke nkwel a ndɛ.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛ̃nkwa-mviil mi taa-taa anã?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ngyi onse ɔ̃kiri wu m'otiil o ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃: Baal bɛn k'amwɛn wɛ amwɛn, b'amwɛn akal ɛ̃nkwa-mviil!» <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Ŋ'eyoo afalisaye ke kwɛ b'áli ye ndɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Bee bam hɛ̃ ɛ̃nkwa-mviil eli?» <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Okɛɛn byɛ al'eli ɛ̃nkwa-mviil, byɛ k'ekal y'obi wɛ. Kɛn onge bɛn byɛ eyɛɛn wɛn: “Bee emwɛn”, byɛ èkal anga-ãbi.»<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Mboo a ɔ̃mbuaal y'emɛmɛɛ̃ e ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yeso oyɛɛn bubu: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mbuul wɛn k'asam onse ekɔɔ ki emɛmɛɛ̃ m'ɔ̃nywã a kyɛ wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ owueel kyɛ ke mboo nkyam, ndɛ ondɛ oli mbuul a pfuul, bvool oli edzuul. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Kɛn a wu asam m'ɔ̃nywã, oli ɔ̃mbuaal a emɛmɛɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Ndɛ ondɛ, wu edzweel ɔ̃nkiaal edzoo, emɛmɛɛ̃ eyoo nkii a ndɛ. Ndɛ ata emɛmɛɛ̃ e ndyam mbel m'ãnkuũ ã bvɛ, bvool abiri bvɛ onkwel-a-nzi. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Ŋ'epaal ndɛ bvɛ bvieel nkwel-a-nzi, ndɛ adzuu ke nkwel a bvɛ. Emɛmɛɛ̃ eluɛɛn a ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bvɛ eyɛɛ nkii a ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Bvɛ k'èluɛɛn ɔ̃nzii bam wɛ, bvɛ èbal ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bvɛ k'eyɛɛ nkii a anzii wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yeso olieel bɔ ãyɛɛn omɔ̃ m'ãmboo, kɛn a bɔ k'akwaal m'ékeyɛɛn ndɛ otsɛn wɛ.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃mbuaal a emɛmɛɛ̃ wa ngesɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yeso bvool olieel bɔ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn wɛn, mɛ̃ wu ndi edzoo ki emɛmɛɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Baal bueel b'ayi nkwel a mɛ̃ ali baal a pfuul, bvool ali edzuul. Kɛn emɛmɛɛ̃ k'eyoo bɔ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi edzoo: Okɛɛn mbuul osam me mɛ̃, ndɛ àbvuul. Ndɛ àsam, àpal, bvool àbɔɔ bvi-odza. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mbuul a pfuul abeya kɛn a m'oturu, m'obam, bvool m'otsal. Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ngyi, me ndɔɔ yɛn baal akal y'elaã, akal ye lɔ lam ngamfɛn. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Mɛ̃ wu ndi ɔ̃mbuaal a emɛmɛɛ̃ wa ngesɛ. Ɔ̃mbuaal a emɛmɛɛ̃ wa ngesɛ akab omwiĩ o ndɛ me ndɔɔ emɛmɛɛ̃ e ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Ŋ'emwɛn mbuul wu awel m'owal enga-mbwel ayeya, ndɛ wɛn k'ali ɔ̃mbuaal wɛ, bvool wɛn emɛmɛɛ̃ hɛ̃ k'eli bvi ndɛ wɛ, ndɛ adzam ntiin ayiri emɛmɛɛ̃. Oŋɔ̃ enga-mbwel eyiool me bvɛ, bu etsal bvɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Ndɛ wu awel me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal, ndɛ k'akɛɛ emɛmɛɛ̃ nguo wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Mɛ̃ wu ndi ɔ̃mbuaal a emɛmɛɛ̃ wa ngesɛ. Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ emɛmɛɛ̃ e mɛ̃, emɛmɛɛ̃ e mɛ̃ hɛ̃ eyɛɛ mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Emfa ngemɔ̃ kyɛn, Taal oyɛɛ mɛ̃, bvool kyɛn mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ngyɛɛ Taal, mɛ̃ ekab elaã e mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a emɛmɛɛ̃ e mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Mɛ̃ kɛn ndi y'emɛmɛɛ̃ ekyam bvɛn k'eli onse ekɔɔ ki wɛ. Bvɛ obvɛ, ebvaan mɛ̃ ebiri bvɛ hɛ̃. Bvɛ ekieel eyoo nkii a mɛ̃. Obobɔ, bvɛ ekieel ekal nkel ngamɔ̃, bvool ekal ɔ̃mbuaal ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Okɛɛn Taal odzii mɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ ekab elaã e mɛ̃, m'owal o lɔ bvool. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'akoo m'ombaal o mɛ̃ lɔ wɛ, kɛn a myam mbuul wu ewa lɔ m'ãtsam ã myam. Mɛ̃ ndi y'omfam b'ewa lɔ, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ndi y'omfam b'ewal lɔ bvool. Obɔ ontam b'etam Taal mɛ̃.» <verse eid="JHN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Okab bvool osam onse Ayuda me ndɔɔ ãyɛɛn omɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Bibi onse bɔ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Ndɛ oli y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi, ndɛ oli y'owool, ki eyoo byɛ ndɛ emã?» <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Bakyɛ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Ãyɛɛn omɔ̃ k'ãli mã mbuul wa y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi wɛ. Ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi lɔɔ-okal okoo k'adzweel mviil m'ɛ̃nkwa-mviil?»<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atiɔ Yeso eboo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, abɛɛl pfuun li osuɔɔl o nzɔ a Nziã ke Yelusalem. Éli me lio li mfyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yeso ákedzuu onse ekɔɔ e Nzɔ a Nziã ke pfoo a Salomɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Ayuda bu adzii ndɛ, bvool alieel ndɛ bubu: «Yɛ bee ɛ̃kwal ke ywel tiil mpanki asuul? Okɛɛn Mãsia yɛ, mpii liaal bee ndɔɔ kal-a-kal!» <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ yɔ, byɛ k'ekiool wɛ. Ki etsweel mɛ̃, eli ɛ̃sal mi esa mɛ̃ ndyam me nkuũ a Tal a mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Kɛn okɛɛn byɛ bam k'ekiool wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ k'eli ba nkel a emɛmɛɛ̃ e mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Emɛmɛɛ̃ e mɛ̃ ebeyoo nkii a mɛ̃. Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ bvɛ, bvool bvɛ ebeluɛɛn a mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Mɛ̃ ndyam ewa bɔ elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. Bɔ kieel k'adziɔɔn bam wɛ, bvool mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'akoo k'awɛɛl bvɛ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Ki ewi Taal mɛ̃ enduru bvieel. Mbuul k'akoo m'owɛɛl o kyɛ me kuɔɔl e Taal wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Mɛ̃ ye Taal eli mbuul ngɔmɔ̃.» <verse eid="JHN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Ayuda bvool atwel ãnkɔɔn m'obam o Yeso me mɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «Mɛ̃ nsuo byɛ ɛ̃sal mi ngesɛ bibi mi ɛ̃fi ola Taal. Onse ɛ̃sal omyɛ̃, wu ebam byɛ mɛ̃ m'ãnkɔɔn me ndɔɔ a ndɛ wɛn?» <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Ayuda abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ki ebam yɛ bee yɛ m'ãnkɔɔn, ke me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal wa ngesɛ wɛ, me ndɔɔ yi esiaan yɛ nkuũ a Nziã, ke ngwel wɛ, yɛ okal mbuul, yɛ ayɛɛn wɛn yɛ li Nziã!» <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Ákel onse Ngel a byɛ ndiri: “Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn wɛn: Byɛ eli anziã!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Ãnz 82.6</ref></char></note>” K'obobɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Okɛɛn Nziã oti b'ékeyɛɛn endɔɔ e ndɛ me ndɔɔ a bɔ m'anziã, k'akoo m'ombaal o m'ákel wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Bɛn byɛ, byɛ eyɛɛn wu éfaal Tal bvool áyuɔɔl ndɛ onse ɔ̃kiri wɛn: “Yɛ asiaan Nziã!” me ndɔɔ yi ngyɛɛn mɛ̃ wɛn: “Mɛ̃ ndi Muaan a Nziã!” <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Okɛɛn mɛ̃ k'esa ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ Tal a mɛ̃ wɛ, ebee mɛ̃ okiool. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Kɛn okɛɛn mɛ̃ esa ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ Taal, onkyam ŋɛn byɛ k'ekiool mɛ̃ wɛ, ekiool si ekal ɛ̃sal, eyɛɛ bvool okwaal otsɛn wɛn, Taal oli onse mɛ̃, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ndi onse taal.» <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Bɔ bvool abii k'asiin ndɛ, kɛn a ndɛ osuɛɛn onse mviɔɔl ɛ̃ bɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Ndɛ okɔɔl ongwel a Dzolodɛ̃, ke mboo yi éwi Dzaã baal opongo tsɔɔn, bvool okal oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Baal bibi ayi ola ndɛ. Bɔ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Dzaã k'asi emvieel si ngemɔ̃ wɛ, kɛn a mbueel m'éyɛɛn ndɛ me ndɔɔ a mbuul wu ã́li taa-taa.» <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Etɔ oŋɔ̃, baal bibi alɔ okiool onse Yeso.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Epfu e Ladzaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Éli y'ɔ̃bieel ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Ladzaal ke Betani, ola o Mali ye Maate wu muaan-goo a ndɛ wu Mali. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Mali wu ákel Yeso ãnasi me ntaã, bvool ákiɔɔn yɔ me mfu e ndɛ. Wu áli y'ãluu, éli Ladzaal wu muaan-ngoo a ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Ankyel ange-buaal ayuɔɔl mbuul oyeliaal Yeso ndiri: «Mfam, nga-ndoo a yɛ oli y'ãluu.» <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Ŋ'eyoo Yeso obobɔ, ndɛ olieel bubu: «Ãluu omɔ̃ k'ãbiri ndɛ k'epfu wɛ, mɔ̃ ãli me ndɔɔ a lweel e Nziã, kwɛn me nkuul a mɔ̃, alweel Muaan a Nziã.» <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Yeso ákedzii Maate, ye muaan-ngoo a ndɛ, ye Ladzaal. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Ŋ'eyoo ndɛ ndiri Ladzaal áli y'ãluu, ndɛ kɛn okal ãtsoo mbuaal ke mboo yi éli ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Ndɛ bu alieel ayio a ndɛ bubu: «Bia-byɛ ebvool Yude.» <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Ayio alieel ndɛ bubu: «Rabbi, lyal Ayuda akebii yɛ wu abam m'ãnkɔɔn okɔ, bɛn yɛ bu abii k'akɔɔl okɔ!» <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Tsoo ke m'ãlio kuun ye mbuaal eli wɛ? Okɛɛn mbuul odzuu ŋ'ebal mwiĩ, ndɛ k'abɛɛl tsa wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ amwɛn mwiĩ a ɔ̃kiri wu. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Kɛn okɛɛn mbuul adzuu me tsia, ndɛ abɛɛl tsa, ke ngwel wɛ mwiĩ k'ali onse ndɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Ke mbee a ŋ'eyɛɛn Yeso obobɔ, ndɛ olweel bubu: «Ladzaal wu ndoo a bia-byɛ olaal twal, kɛn a mɛ̃ èyeseel ndɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Ayio alieel ndɛ bubu: «Mfam, okɛɛn ndɛ alaal twal, ndɛ àbvuul.» <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yeso ákeyɛɛn me ndɔɔ epfu e Ladzaal, kɛn a bɔ áketsam ndiri ndɛ ákeyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a twal li ãtsoo mbueel. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Yeso bu alieel bɔ kal-a-kal ndiri: «Ladzaal amaakwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Mɛ̃ esia mpaa me ndɔɔ a byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ k'eli oŋɔ̃ wɛ, kwɛn byɛ ekiool. Kɛn a bia-byɛ eyi ola ndɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Toma, wu ata me «Mbu», olieel ayio bakyɛ ndiri: «Bia-byɛ hɛ̃ eyi, kwɛn bia-byɛ ekwa y'Ɔ̃tee a bia-byɛ!»<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso, osiool y'elaã.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Ŋ'etɔ Yeso Betani, ndɛ oyebɔɔ Ladzaal amaasa ãtsoo ãnã onse mpiɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Betani áli tsotsoo a Yelusalem, akilometele sua atyel. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Ayuda bibi áyi ola Maate ye Mali, me ndɔɔ yi abweel bɔ me ndɔɔ epfu e nkyel a bɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Ŋ'eyoo Maate ndiri Yeso ákeya, ndɛ oyi ke nkwel a ndɛ. Kɛn a Mali ásiil me nsɛn ke nzɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Maate olieel Yeso bubu: «Mfam, okɛɛn yɛ ali ŋã, nkyel a mɛ̃ k'akaakwa wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Kɛn onkyam meba, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ wɛn ndɔɔ yueel yi èsɔɔ yɛ ola Nziã, ndɛ àwa yɛ yɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Nkyel a yɛ akieel asiool.» <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Maate obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ wɛn ndɛ akieel asiool ŋ'ekieel esiool baal, me tsoo e ntɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yeso olieel ndɛ bubu: «Mɛ̃ ndyam ndi osiool y'elaã. Mbuul wu alɔ okiool onse mɛ̃ àkal mwiĩ, onkyam ŋɛn ndɛ okwi. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Mbuul wueel wu oli mwiĩ, bvool olɔ okiool o ndɛ onse mɛ̃, kieel k'akwa bam wɛ. Yɛ kiool obobɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Ndɛ obveel Yeso ndiri: «Ngwanyã, Mfam, mɛ̃ bam nkiool wɛn yɛ wu li Mãsia, Muaan a Nziã wu aya onse ɔ̃kiri.»<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso olel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Ŋ'eman Maate obobɔ oyɛɛn, ndɛ oyɛn. Ndɛ bu ati Mali wu muaan-ngoo a ndɛ mbel me pyɛ, olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee amaaya, ndɛ ata yɛ mbel.» <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Ŋ'eyoo Mali obobɔ, ndɛ otɛɛn tswa-tswa, bu ayɛn ola ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ ale kɛn asam ola wɛ. Ndɛ áli kɛn ke mboo yi éyemwɛɛn Maate ye ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Ayuda b'áli onse nzɔ ye Mali m'obweel o ndɛ, amwɛn k'etɛɛn ndɛ tswa-tswa bvool apal. Bɔ bu aluɛɛn a ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ áketsam ndiri ndɛ ákeyi olel ke mpiɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Ŋ'etɔ Mali ke mboo yi éli Yeso, bvool ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ ndɛ, ndɛ obvi ke ntaã e ndɛ, bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Mfam, okɛɛn yɛ al'ali ŋã, nkyel a mɛ̃ k'akaakwa wɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Ŋ'emwɛn Yeso ndɛ alel, bvool ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ hɛ̃ Ayuda b'áyi ye ndɛ alel, ndɛ oyoo ãnyiĩ bibi bvool ɔ̃kwal obii. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Ndɛ oyɛɛn ndiri: «Byɛ ndɛ kwɛn olɔ?» Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, ya bvool mwɛn!» <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yeso bu alel. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Ayuda ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Ndɛ bam ali ndoo a ndɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Bakyɛ onse bɔ ayɛɛn ndiri: «Ndɛ wu adzweel mviil m'ɔ̃nkwa-mviil, ndɛ ale k'akoo hɛ̃ m'osa kwɛn mbuul wu abee okwa wɛ?»<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oseel Ladzaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yeso bvool oluul me nyiĩ, bu ayɛn mpiɛɛn. Mpiɛɛn oyɔ, éli onse ãnkɔɔn, bvool ásuul nkɔɔn k'ɔ̃nywã a yɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yeso oyɛɛn bubu: «Embaal nkɔɔn.» Kɛn a Maate wu nkyel a ɔ̃pfu, olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, ndɛ oyii aya nswel, ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ amaasa ãtsoo ãnã.» <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ k'eyɛɛn yɛ wɛn, okɛɛn yɛ kiool, yɛ àmwɛn omfam o Nziã wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Obobɔ, bɔ ambaal nkɔɔn. Yeso oseel mviil ke ywel, bvool oyɛɛn ndiri: «Taal, mɛ̃ ntuɛɛn yɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn yɛ yoo mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Me b'otal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛ wɛn yɛ abeyoo mɛ̃ kɛn oyoo, kɛn a mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn obobɔ me ndɔɔ embuul ki eli ŋã, kwɛn bɔ akiool wɛn ye mbuul wu otam mɛ̃.» <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ke mbee a ŋ'eyɛɛn ndɛ obobɔ, ndɛ obiool kokɔ ndiri: «Ladzaal, pal onse oŋɔ̃!» <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Wu akwi bu apal, ntaã ye mviil akuru m'ɛ̃mpa mi ekɔ, osu afoo m'ekɔ. Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «Enyiɔɔn ndɛ, bvool eyɔɔl ndɛ ayi.»<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfoo yi mbi yi akuru Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Ayuda bibi b'áyi ola Mali amwɛn ãndɔɔ m'ési Yeso. Bɔ bu alɔ okiool onse ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Kɛn a bakyɛ onse bɔ ayɛn eyebɔɔ afalisaye, bu alieel bɔ m'ési Yeso. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Obobɔ, angaa-a-Nziã b'anɛn y'afalisaye abvool mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda, bu alieel ndiri: «Bia-byɛ eyii bwɛn esa? Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu kwɛn asa emvieel bibi. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Okɛɛn bia-byɛ eyɔɔl ndɛ asa obobɔ, baal bueel akieel alɔ okiool onse ndɛ. Obobɔ, baal a Lom ol'ayetsal mboo a bia-byɛ y'ɔ̃kiri a bia-byɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ, Kayif, wu ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn me mvel ondɛ, olieel bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ bam ki eyɛɛ pyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Byɛ k'emwɛn kwɛn eli ngesɛ kwɛn mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ akwa me ndɔɔ a baal, bvool kwɛn ɔ̃kiri wueel abee nkel oyi wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Ke yam, ndɛ k'ákeyɛɛn obobɔ me ndyam wɛ, kɛn onge bɛn ndɛ áli ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn me mvel ondɛ, ndɛ ákeyɛɛn ãndɔɔ m'ãfa ola Nziã, ndiri Yeso ákaakwa me ndɔɔ ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Ke kɛn a me ndɔɔ ɔ̃kiri wɛ, me ndɔɔ yi abvool hɛ̃ baan a Nziã b'átsɔɔn, kwɛn bɔ akal yam ngelemɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Bɛɛn tsoo olɔ, bɔ akuru k'abam ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Obobɔ, Yeso k'abedzuu kal-a-kal onse Ayuda wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ ombal oŋɔ̃, bu ayɛn etswi e nsie ki tsotsoo ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ, ke bviil li ata m'Efalayim. Ndɛ ákekal okɔ y'ayio a ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Pfuun li Onduru al'eyii tsotsoo, baal bibi b'ɔ̃kiri ayi Yelusalam ye k'etɔ tsoo e pfuun, m'osa b'ɔ̃kiri wu akal tsɛtsɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Bɔ ákebii Yeso, bvool ákefuul bam-a-bam onse Nzɔ a Nziã bubu: «Byɛ emwɛn bwɛn? Ndɛ ke pfuun bam aya wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Oŋɔ̃ ŋɛn angaa-a-Nziã b'anɛn y'afalisaye al'amaatam baal ndiri, mbuul wu oyɛɛ mboo yi eli ndɛ, awa bɔ nsia, kwɛn asiin ndɛ.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ãnasi m'ayiri Yeso me ntaã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Ŋ'esiil ãtsoo ãsɛɛn m'abɛɛl pfuun li Onduru, Yeso oyi Betani, mboo yi éli Ladzaal wu éseel ndɛ onse b'ákwi-ákwi. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Okɔ, abɛɛl pfuun me ndɔɔ a Yeso. Maate ákekab bvi-odza. Ladzaal áli ngɔmɔ̃ onse baal b'áli ke misa ye ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Obobɔ, Mali owel etswel e litele ki ãnasi mã naad m'ãywɛn a ɔ̃mfee. Ãnasi omɔ̃, ãli mã nzi bibi. Mali osɛɛn mɔ̃ me ntaã e Yeso, bvool oyieel yɔ me mfu e ndɛ. Nzɔ yueel bu eluul me nswel a ãnasi. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Yuda Isikaliot wu ngɔmɔ̃ onse ayio a Yeso, wu átiɔ ndɛ wu Yeso, oyɛɛn bubu: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />«Otsɛn omã bɛn k'atiɔ ãnasi mã me nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃kam ɛ̃tyel (300), kwɛn awa yɔ aywal wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Ndɛ ŋ'ákeyɛɛn obobɔ, ke me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ ákekɛɛ aywal nguo wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ áli mbuul a pfuul, bvool me ndɔɔ yɛn ŋ'ékekwɛɛ ndɛ nkab, ndɛ áketuru nzi yi ákelɔ onse okɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Kɛn a Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɔɔl ndɛ akwɛɛ ãnasi omɔ̃ me ndɔɔ a tsoo li àlɔ mɛ̃ onse mpiɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, aywal, byɛ èkal ye bɔ lio lueel. Kɛn a mɛ̃, byɛ k'èkal ye mɛ̃ lio lueel wɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mfoo yi mbi me ndɔɔ a Ladzaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Embuul ki Ayuda eyeyɛɛ kwɛn Yeso áli okɔ. Bɔ ayi, ke kɛn a me ndɔɔ a Yeso wɛ, me ndɔɔ yi amwɛn Ladzaal hɛ̃, wu éseel ndɛ onse b'ákwi-ákwi. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Obobɔ, angaa-a-Nziã b'anɛn akuru k'abam Ladzaal hɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />Ke ngwel wɛ, me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, Ayuda bibi átiɔ bɔ eboo, bvool ákelɔ okiool onse Yeso.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osam o Yeso onse Yelusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Ŋ'etsi bviil, embuul e baal b'áyi pfuun li Onduru ayoo ndiri Yeso ákeya Yelusalem. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Bɔ awel nsuɛɛn yi ãba, apal ke nkwel a ndɛ, abiool ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">«Hodzana!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">Yɔɔl kwɛn ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl okal y'Ɔ̃kwɛn a Isalayel wu aya me nkuũ a Mfam!»<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yeso omwɛn muaan-ane, bu abvi nsɛn nkal a ndɛ, onge b'ákel ndiri:<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />«Muaan wu ɔ̃kaal wa Siɔ̃, oyɛɛ ke bal wɛ: Mfam a yɛ àya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">obvi nsɛn nkal muaan-ane<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Dza 9.9</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Me lio olɔ, ayio a Yeso k'abɔɔ ndɔɔ oyɔ otsɛn wɛ, kɛn a ŋ'andɛɛl ndɛ onse lweel, bɔ ayeyeel ndiri ákel ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, bvool ndiri bɔ ási mɔ̃ me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Embuul ki éli ye ndɛ ŋ'éti ndɛ Ladzaal mbel ke mpiɛɛn m'oseel o ndɛ onse b'ákwi-ákwi, atsweel ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn embuul eyemwɛɛn ye ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ áyoo ndiri ndɛ ási emvieel okyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Afalisaye bu ayɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Byam oŋɔ̃ emwɛn wɛn byɛ ki ebesa pyɛ: Baal bueel ayii anɔɔn a ndɛ!»<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agelek abii k'amwɛn Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Onse baal b'áyi Yelusalem m'olweel o Nziã me lio e pfuun li Onduru, éli y'Agelek ke kwɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Bɔ asyel tsotsoo a Filipe, wu áli ɔ̃fi-ola bo Betesayida ke nsie yi Ngalile, alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Taal, bee edzii k'emwɛn Yeso.» <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipe oyɛn oyeliaal Andel. Andel ye Filipe bu ayeliaal Yeso. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yeso bu alieel bɔ ndiri: «Lio emeekoo lɛn ebvaan alweel Muaan a mbuul. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, esia e bele k'ebvi me nsie, bvool ekwii wɛ, lɔ ekal lam-sii. Kɛn lɔ ekwa, lɔ eburu bibi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Mbuul wu okuru nzuru m'elaã e ndɛ, aywɛn a lɔ, kɛn a ŋɛn mbuul obyel elaã e ndɛ onse ɔ̃kiri wu, ndɛ akieel akwɛɛ lɔ me ndɔɔ elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Okɛɛn mbuul odzii k'asal me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ aluɛɛn a mɛ̃. Mboo yi ndi mɛ̃, yi ekieel ekal ɔ̃sal a mɛ̃ hɛ̃. Okɛɛn mbuul odzii k'asal me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃, wu àlweel ndɛ Taal.»<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ epfu e ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />«Meba ŋã, ɔ̃kwal a mɛ̃ obii. B'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ omã? Taal, paal mɛ̃ onse lio li. Kɛn obɔ otsɛn be ngyi mɛ̃ me lio li. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Taal, lweel nkuũ a yɛ!» Nkii bu efi ywel elieel bubu: «Mɛ̃ ndweel yɔ, mɛ̃ ekieel elweel yɔ bvool.» <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Embuul e baal ki éli oŋɔ̃, bvool éyoo nkii oyɔ, ékeyɛɛn ndiri éli nzyel. Bakyɛ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Ãnzwel ãyɛɛn ye ndɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yeso oyɛɛn ndiri: «Nkii oyɔ, ke me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ eyɛɛn wɛ, yɔ me ndɔɔ a byɛ eyɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Meba ŋã, àwa ɔ̃kiri wu etumbu, bvool meba ŋã, àtyal mfam wu ɔ̃bi wu ɔ̃kiri wu onkwel-a-nzi. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Mɛ̃, ŋ'akieel andɛɛl mɛ̃ ywel fa nsie, mɛ̃ ekieel edzuru baal bueel ola mɛ̃.» <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />M'oyɛɛn obɔ, Yeso ŋ'ákesuo emfa ki epfu li ekieel ekwa ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Embuul e baal ebveel ndiri: «Bee bam eyoo kwɛn Ngel esuo wɛn Mãsia akieel akal ɔ̃bu. K'emfa emã kyɛn yɛ koo m'oyɛɛn wɛn: “Ebvaan andɛɛl Muaan a mbuul.” Muaan a mbuul ondɛ ndyam nã?» <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Mwiĩ kɛn abebal onse byɛ me muaan-lio. Edzuu ŋ'eli byɛ kɛn me mwiĩ, kwɛn empeel ebee obva ola byɛ enseel. Ke ngwel wɛ, wu adzuu onse empeel k'ayɛɛ ku eyi ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Ŋ'eli byɛ kɛn me mwiĩ, ekal y'okiool me mwiĩ, kwɛn byɛ ekɔɔl baan a mwiĩ.» Yeso ayeyɛɛn obobɔ, ndɛ oyɛn bu adziɔɔn lala ye bɔ.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayuda abee k'akiool Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Onkyam ŋɛn ndɛ ási emvieel bibi ke mviil ã bɔ, bɔ k'ákelɔ okiool o bɔ onse ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />M'emfa okyɛ, asi m'éyɛɛn ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã Edzayi, ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">«Mfam, wu okiool m'eyɛɛn bee nã?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Waan e Mfam Nziã ola nã áyɛɛl lɔ?»<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Baal ba k'akoo m'okiool wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ Edzayi bvool áyɛɛn bubu:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />«Ndɛ obam mviil ã bɔ, bvool owi bɔ ɔ̃kwal mpɛn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Kwɛn bɔ abee omwɛn me mviil ã bɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">abee otsɛn okwaal m'ãyal ã bɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">bvool kwɛn bɔ abee ola mɛ̃ okɔɔl, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ mboo bɔ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Edz 6.10</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Edzayi oyɛɛn obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ omwɛn lweel o Yeso, ndɛ ákeyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ndɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Kɛn onse amfam, bibi alɔ okiool onse Yeso. Kɛn a me ndɔɔ afalisaye, bɔ k'ákiool ndɛ ke nkwel a baal wɛ: Bɔ ákebal owɛɛl atswɛɛl bɔ onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ ádzii lweel li ewa baal, ke mboo a li ewa Nziã.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obɔɔ b'etumbu m'ãyɛɛn ã Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yeso obiool kokɔ ndiri: «Mbuul wu olɔ okiool o ndɛ onse mɛ̃, ndɛ k'alɔ bɔ onse mɛ̃ wɛ, ndɛ olɔ bɔ onse wu oyuɔɔl mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Wu omwɛn mɛ̃, ŋ'amwɛn wu oyuɔɔl mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Mɛ̃ wu mwiĩ, mɛ̃ ngyi onse ɔ̃kiri, kwɛn wu olɔ okiool onse mɛ̃ abee onse empeel okal. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Ŋɛn mbuul oyoo ãyɛɛn ã mɛ̃, k'akwee mɔ̃ wɛ, mɛ̃ k'ewa ndɛ etumbu wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ k'ɔ̃kiri me mbyel ngyi obam wɛ, mɛ̃ ɔ̃kiri ngyi obvuul. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Mbuul wu otiɔ mɛ̃ eboo, bvool k'ayɔɔ ãyɛɛn ã mɛ̃ wɛ, wu awa ndɛ etumbu Taal: Eyɛɛn li ngyɛɛn mɛ̃, èwa ndɛ etumbu me tsoo e ntɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a myam wɛ. Taal wu oyuɔɔl mɛ̃, ndyam wu otam mɛ̃ k'eyɛɛn, ye ndɔɔ yi èyɛɛn mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ngyɛɛ wɛn otam o ndɛ oli elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. Obobɔ, b'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ m'otam obɔ, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn bɔ m'emfa ki etam Taal mɛ̃ oyɛɛn.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso osuɔɔl ntaã yi ayio a ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Ye k'ekoo lio e Pfuun li Onduru, Yeso al'amaayɛɛ kwɛn lio al'emeekoo li embal ndɛ ɔ̃kiri wu bvool ayi ola Taal. Ndɛ wu ádzii baal a ndɛ b'áli onse ɔ̃kiri, ndɛ bvool odzii bɔ bibi tiil ntɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yeso y'ayio a ndɛ ákedza m'ãnkunkwal. Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Ɔ̃pfu al'amaalɔ ãtsam m'atiɔ Yeso onse ɔ̃kwal a Yuda, wu muaan a Simɔ̃ Isikaliot. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Kɛn a Yeso áyɛɛ kwɛn Tal áwi ãndɔɔ mam mbueel me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndɛ, áyɛɛ kwɛn ndɛ áfi ola Nziã, bvool áyɛɛ kwɛn ndɛ àyi ola Nziã. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Ndɛ otɛɛn ke misa, odzuul ekɔ ki abelaal ke ywel ɔ̃kuru, owel epie ki ekɔ, bu akuru kyɛ me luu. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ olɔ ãdza onse saan li enɛn, obvi ayio a ndɛ ntaã osuɔɔl, bu ayieel yɔ m'ekɔ ki ekuru ndɛ m'eluu. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Ndɛ oyi ola Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl. Piɛɛl olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, yɛ ndyam asuɔɔl mɛ̃ ntaã?» <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Ndɔɔ yi esa mɛ̃ bam, yɛ ndyam k'akwaal yɔ otsɛn meba wɛ, kɛn a yɛ akieel akwaal yɔ otsɛn ke mbee.» <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Piɛɛl obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, yɛ ke koo bam m'osuɔɔl mɛ̃ ntaã wɛ!» Ndɛ obveel Piɛɛl ndiri: «Okɛɛn mɛ̃ ke nsuɔɔl yɛ ntaã wɛ, yɛ k'àkal ye bvoo ye mɛ̃ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, okɛɛn obobɔ, bee kɛn a ntaã osuɔɔl, suɔɔl hɛ̃ mviɔɔl ɛ̃ mɛ̃ y'ɔ̃tswɛ a mɛ̃.» <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mbuul wu amaayɔɔ ãdza oli ye kɔɔ li asuɔɔl kɛn a ntaã. Ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ oli ndyam wueel tsɛtsɛ. Byɛ, byɛ eli tsɛtsɛ, kɛn a ke byɛ bueel wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Yeso áyɛɛ wu akieel atiɔ ndɛ. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn ndɛ oyɛɛn ndiri: «Byɛ bueel k'eli tsɛtsɛ wɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ke mbee a ŋ'esuɔɔl ndɛ bɔ ntaã, ndɛ obveel ekɔ me nzuru, obvool ke misa, bu afuul bɔ bubu: «Byɛ ekwaal otsɛn o be nsi mɛ̃ byɛ? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Byɛ, byɛ ebeta mɛ̃ m'Ɔ̃tee bvool me Mfam, byɛ eli y'ɔ̃dzoo, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ndi Ɔ̃tee bvool ndi Mfam. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Okɛɛn mɛ̃ wu ndi Mfam bvool ndi Ɔ̃tee, nsuɔɔl byɛ ntaã, byɛ hɛ̃ ebvaan esuɔɔl bakyɛ ntaã. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ nsuo byɛ emfa ki asa, kwɛn byɛ hɛ̃ esa onge be nsi mɛ̃ byɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ɔ̃sal k'anduru mfam a ndɛ wɛ, ntam hɛ̃ k'anduru wu otam ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Okɛɛn byɛ eyɛɛ obobɔ, byɛ eli baal b'esɛ, oŋɔ̃ ŋɛn byɛ esi be ngyɛɛn mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛn bɔ me ndɔɔ a byɛ bueel wɛ. Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ be nsueel mɛ̃. Kɛn a ebvaan asa m'ákel ndiri: “Wu adza mampa ye mɛ̃ oyii ɔ̃taal a mɛ̃.” <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ yɔ meba, me ndɔɔ yɛn ŋ'ekieel aya ndɔɔ oyɔ, byɛ eyɛɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ ndyam ndi. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn wɛn, wu ayɔɔ wu ntam mɛ̃, wu oyɔɔ mɛ̃, wu oyɔɔ mɛ̃, wu oyɔɔ wu otam mɛ̃.»<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oyɛɛn ndiri Yuda akieel atiɔ ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Ke mbee a ŋ'eyɛɛn Yeso obobɔ, ɔ̃kwal a ndɛ obii, ndɛ bu ayɛɛn bubu: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ àtiɔ mɛ̃.» <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Ayio atal bakyɛ, bvool abvi afuul bam-a-bam me ndɔɔ yi abii k'ayɛɛ wu ekeyɛɛn Yeso me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Ngɔmɔ̃ onse ayio, wu ékedzii Yeso áli ke misa, bɔ nkal otwel o ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl opyel ndɛ, kwɛn ndɛ afuul Yeso me ndɔɔ yi ayɛɛ mbuul nã wu ékeyɛɛn ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Ɔ̃yio ondɛ oyiɔɔl nzuru nkal otwel o Yeso, bu afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, wu ebeyɛɛn yɛ nã?» <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Mɛ̃ ètob etswel e mampa onse mbiɔ, mbuul wu èwa mɛ̃ kyɛ, ndɛ ondɛ.» Yeso owel etswel e mampa, otob kyɛ onse mbiɔ, bu awi Yuda wu muaan a Simɔ̃ Isikaliot. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Kɛn a ŋ'ewel Yuda etswel e mampa okyɛ, Ɔ̃pfu osam onse ndɛ. Obobɔ, Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Ndɔɔ yi esa yɛ, sa yɔ tswa-a-tswa!» <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ onse b'áli ke misa k'akwaal otsɛn b'ékeyɛɛn Yeso ndɛ obobɔ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Ke ngwel wɛ, onge bɛn Yuda áli mbuul wu ákesiin nkab a nzi, ayio bakyɛ áketsam ndiri Yeso ŋ'átam ndɛ ndiri: «Suun eluɔ bvi eli bia-byɛ ye kɔɔ e bvɛ me ndɔɔ a pfuun», wuo ndɛ ákeyɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: «Yi ayewa wuaal ol'aywal.» <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Obobɔ, ke mbee a ŋ'ewel Yuda etswel e mampa, ndɛ opal alili oŋɔ̃. Tsia al'amaabva.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngel yi nyiɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ke mbee a ŋ'epal Yuda, Yeso olieel bubu: «Meba ŋã, lweel e Muaan a mbuul emɔɔn, bvool Nziã abɔɔ lweel me nkuul a ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />[Onge bɛn lweel e Nziã emɔɔn me nkuul a ndɛ,]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi, k'áyɛɛn yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note> Nziã hɛ̃ àsa kwɛn me nkuul a ndyam, lweel e Muaan emɔɔn, bvool ndɛ àsa yɔ alili oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Baan a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ kɛn ndi ye byɛ me muaan-lio. Byɛ ekieel ebii mɛ̃, kɛn a meba, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn ye byɛ onge b'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ Ayuda wɛn: Ku èyi mɛ̃ ndyam, byɛ bam k'ekoo m'oyi okɔ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Mɛ̃ ngwi byɛ ngel yi nyiɔɔn yi: Edzii bakyɛ. Onge be ndzii byɛ, byɛ hɛ̃ edzii bakyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Okɛɛn byɛ eli ye dzii onse byɛ, baal bueel ayɛɛ kwɛn byɛ eli ayio a mɛ̃.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oyɛɛn ndiri Piɛɛl àtwɛn ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl ofuul Yeso ndiri: «Mfam, yɛ kwɛn ayi?» Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ku èyi mɛ̃, yɛ ke koo m'onɔɔn o mɛ̃ meba wɛ, yɛ akieel anɔɔn a mɛ̃ m'ãtsoo m'ãya.» <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Piɛɛl bvool ofuul ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, otsɛn omã bɛn mɛ̃ ke nkoo m'onɔɔn o yɛ meba wɛ? Mɛ̃ nkoo m'okab omwiĩ o mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a yɛ». <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ wɛn yɛ koo m'okab omwiĩ o yɛ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃? Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɛ wɛn, ye k'ekuaal nswee, yɛ akieel atwɛn nsa tyel wɛn yɛ ke yɛɛ mɛ̃ wɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Nkuul yi ayi ola Taal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yeso olieel ndiri: «Yɔɔl kwɛn ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ ɛ̃bee obii. Elɔ okiool o byɛ onse Nziã, elɔ okiool o byɛ hɛ̃ onse mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Onse nzɔ a tal a mɛ̃, ãngwel m'ãnzɔ ãli bibi. Al'okɛɛn k'obobɔ wɛ, kɛn mɛ̃ ekeeyɛɛn byɛ wɛn mɛ̃ èyefaal byɛ ngwel-a-nzɔ? <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Ke mbee a ŋe ngyɛn mɛ̃ byɛ mboo oyefaal, mɛ̃ èyebvool, mɛ̃ ewal byɛ eyekal ye myam, kwɛn mboo yi ndi mɛ̃ yam, byɛ hɛ̃, byɛ èkal oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Byɛ eyɛɛ nkuul yi ayi ku èyi mɛ̃.»<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Toma ofuul ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, ku eyi yɛ, bee k'eyɛɛ wɛ, oŋɔ̃ k'eyɛɛ bee nkuul yi ayi okɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Wu oli nkuul mpi mɛ̃, wu oli otaa-taa mpi mɛ̃, wu oli elaã hɛ̃ mpi mɛ̃. Mbuul m'oyi ola Taal, obvie obwel me mɛ̃ ndyam. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Okɛɛn byɛ eyɛɛ mɛ̃, byɛ èyɛɛ Tal a mɛ̃ hɛ̃. Meba ŋã, byɛ eyɛɛ ndɛ, bvool byɛ emwɛn ndɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipe olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, suo bee Taal, oyɔ ndɔɔ yi eli bee ye kɔɔ e yɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Filipe, etel nziil ki ndi mɛ̃ ye byɛ, bɛn yɛ ke yɛɛ mɛ̃ wɛ? Wu omwɛn mɛ̃, ŋ'amwɛn Taal. Otsɛn omã bɛn yɛ ayɛɛn wɛn: “Suo bee Taal?” <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Yɛ k'akiool wɛn mɛ̃ ndyam ndi onse Taal, Taal hɛ̃ oli onse mɛ̃ wɛ? Ãndɔɔ m'ebeyɛɛn mɛ̃ byɛ, mɛ̃ k'ebeyɛɛn mɔ̃ me myam wɛ, Taal wu oli onse mɛ̃, mbuul wu abesa ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndyam. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Elɔ okiool onse mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi onse Taal, bvool Taal oli onse mɛ̃. Okɛɛn k'obobɔ wɛ, ekiool onkyam me ndɔɔ ɛ̃sal mi emwɛn byɛ mɛ̃ esa. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mbuul wu olɔ okiool o ndɛ onse mɛ̃, ndɛ hɛ̃ akieel asa ɛ̃sal mi esa mɛ̃ ndyam. Ndɛ akieel asa myam mi onduru ɔ̃ndel, ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ndyam eyi ola Taal. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Mɛ̃ ekieel esa mbueel m'ekieel esɔɔ byɛ me nkuũ mɛ̃, kwɛn lweel e Taal emɔɔn me nkuul a Muaan. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Ŋɛn byɛ esɔɔ eluɔ ola mɛ̃, me nkuũ a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndyam èsa b'esɔɔ byɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntwel wu àya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />«Okɛɛn byɛ edzii mɛ̃, byɛ ekieel esa m'etam mɛ̃ byɛ osa. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ ekieel esɔɔ ola Taal, kwɛn ndɛ awa byɛ Ntwel ɔ̃kyam, kwɛn ndɛ akal ye byɛ ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Ntwel ondɛ eli Ɔ̃fel wu otaa-taa, wɛn ɔ̃kiri k'akoo m'oyɔɔ o ndɛ wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ k'amwɛn ndɛ wɛ, bvool k'ayɛɛ ndɛ hɛ̃ wɛ. Kɛn a byɛ, byɛ eyɛɛ ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ oli tsotsoo ye byɛ, bvool ndɛ hɛ̃ akieel akal onse byɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Mɛ̃ kieel k'esiil byɛ ensiaan wɛ, mɛ̃ ekieel eyebvool ola byɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Me lio etsi-tsiri, ɔ̃kiri bvool k'àmwɛn mɛ̃ wɛ, kɛn a byɛ, byɛ ekieel emwɛn mɛ̃, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ndi mwiĩ, bvool byɛ hɛ̃, byɛ èkal mwiĩ. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Me tsoo olɔ, byɛ ekieel eyɛɛ wɛn mɛ̃ ndi onse Taal, onge b'eli byɛ onse mɛ̃, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ndi onse byɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Wu odzii mɛ̃, wu oli y'ãngel ã mɛ̃, bvool akiaal mɔ̃. Wu odzii mɛ̃, Taal a mɛ̃ àdzii ndɛ. Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ èdzii ndɛ bvool mɛ̃ èmɔɔn ola ndɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuda, wɛn wu Isikaliot wɛ, ofuul Yeso ndiri: «Mfam, otsɛn omã bɛn yɛ àmɔɔn ola bee, k'àmɔɔn ol'ɔ̃kiri wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Okɛɛn mbuul odzii mɛ̃, ndɛ àkwɛɛ Endɔɔ e mɛ̃, bvool Tal a mɛ̃ àdzii ndɛ. Obobɔ, bee èya ola ndɛ, bvool bee etuu lɔ ola ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Mbuul wɛn k'adzii mɛ̃ wɛ k'akwɛɛ ãndɔɔ ã mɛ̃ wɛ. Bvool Endɔɔ li eyoo byɛ, k'eli li mɛ̃ wɛ, eli li Taal wu oyuɔɔl mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ ãndɔɔ mã ŋe ndi mɛ̃ kɛn ye byɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Kɛn a Ntwel, Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, wu ekieel eyuɔɔl Taal me nkuũ a mɛ̃, akieel ayiool byɛ ãndɔɔ mbueel, bvool akieel ayeel byɛ mbueel me ngyɛɛn mɛ̃ byɛ.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Mɛ̃ nsiil byɛ opi. Mɛ̃ ngwi byɛ opi o mɛ̃. Mɛ̃ k'ewa byɛ onge b'ebewa ɔ̃kiri wɛ. Yɔɔl kwɛn ɔ̃kwal a byɛ abee abii, abee hɛ̃ ye buɔ okal! <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Byɛ eyoo ke ngyɛɛn mɛ̃ byɛ wɛn: “Mɛ̃ èyi, bvool mɛ̃ èyebvool ola byɛ”. Ŋɛn byɛ edzi mɛ̃, byɛ èsia mpal, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ eyi ola Taal. Ke ngwel wɛ, Taal onduru mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ meba, ye k'eya mɔ̃, me ndɔɔ yɛn ŋ'ekieel eya mɔ̃, byɛ èkiool. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Mɛ̃ bvool k'ebeyɛɛn ye byɛ bibi wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mfam ɔ̃kiri wu abeya. Ndɛ k'ali y'okwɛn nkal a mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Kɛn ebvaan kwɛn ɔ̃kiri ayɛɛ ndiri mɛ̃ nzii Taal, bvool kwɛn mɛ̃ ebesa ãndɔɔ m'etam Taal mɛ̃ osa. Etɛɛn, bia-byɛ embal ŋã!»<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃ti a bvine wa taa-taa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />«Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi ɔ̃ti a bvine wa taa-taa, bvool Tal a mɛ̃ oli ɔ̃kwɛn a ɔ̃ti ondɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Ndɛ atsiil pɔɔ̃ lueel li eli me mɛ̃, lɛn k'eburu nsia wɛ. Kɛn a ndɛ afaal pɔɔ̃ lueel li eburu nsia ŋ'ewɛɛ ndɛ lɔ, kwɛn lɔ bvool eburu nsia bibi. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Endɔɔ li ntee mɛ̃ byɛ emeesuul byɛ eyii tsɛtsɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Oŋɔ̃ ekuru nzuru me mɛ̃, onge be nkuru yɔ me byɛ. Emfa kyɛn pɔɔ̃ k'ekoo k'eburu nsia me lam wɛ, okɛɛn lɔ k'ekuru nzuru m'ɔ̃ti a lɔ wa bvine wɛ, emfa kiki hɛ̃, okɛɛn byɛ k'ekuru nzuru me mɛ̃ wɛ, byɛ k'ekoo k'eburu nsia wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi ɔ̃ti a bvine, byɛ, byɛ eli ãmpɔɔ̃. Mbuul wu akuru nzuru me mɛ̃, wɛn mɛ̃ hɛ̃ nkuru nzuru me ndɛ, mbuul ondɛ aburu nsia bibi. Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn mɛ̃ pyɛ, byɛ k'ekoo k'asa ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Mbuul wɛn k'akuru nzuru me mɛ̃ wɛ oli onge pɔɔ̃, li àta pfɛɛ onkwel-a-nzi bvool ekɛɛ. Ãpɔɔ̃ m'ãkɛɛ-ãkɛɛ, atwal mɔ̃ bvool atyal mɔ̃ onse mbaa, oŋɔ̃ mɔ̃ bu ãdzio. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Ŋɛn byɛ ekuru nzuru me mɛ̃, bvool ŋɛn ãndɔɔ ã mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ãkal onse byɛ, esɔɔ bvieel bvi edzii byɛ, byɛ èbɔɔ bvɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Emfa ki emɔɔn lweel e Tal a mɛ̃ kyɛ ki: Ŋɛn byɛ eburu nsia bibi, bvool esuo kwɛn byɛ eli ayio a mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Onge b'edzii Taal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ nzii byɛ. Ekal onse dzii e mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Okɛɛn byɛ ekieel ãngel ã mɛ̃, byɛ èkal onse dzii e mɛ̃, onge b'ebekiaal mɛ̃ ãngel ã Taal, bvool ndi onse dzii e ndɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />«Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ obobɔ, kwɛn esɛ e mɛ̃ ekal onse byɛ bvool kwɛn esɛ e byɛ ekal ɔ̃koo. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Ngel a mɛ̃ yɔ bu: Edzii bakyɛ, onge b'ebedzii mɛ̃ byɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Dzii li enduru ɔ̃ndel lɛn mbuul okoo k'asuo, li ekab ndɛ elaã e ndɛ me ndɔɔ andoo a ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Byɛ, byɛ eli andoo a mɛ̃ okɛɛn byɛ esa bɛn mɛ̃ ndyam ntam byɛ osa. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Mɛ̃ k'ebeta byɛ m'ankyal wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ɔ̃nkyal k'ayɛɛ m'esa mfam a ndɛ wɛ. Mɛ̃ nti byɛ m'andoo, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ nsuo byɛ mbueel me ngyoo mɛ̃ ola Tal a mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Byɛ ke baal b'esueel mɛ̃ wɛ, mɛ̃ mbuul wu nsueel byɛ, bvool ngwi byɛ ontam, kwɛn byɛ, byɛ eyi, byɛ eburu nsia, bvool kwɛn nsia e byɛ eyiil. Obobɔ, Taal àwa byɛ bvieel bvi esɔɔ byɛ ola ndɛ me nkuũ a mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Ndɔɔ yi ntam mɛ̃ byɛ osa, yɛn byɛ edzii bakyɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃kiri obyel Yeso y'ayio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />«Ŋɛn ɔ̃kiri oli ye byal e byɛ, eyɛɛ wɛn ndɛ abyel mɛ̃ ɛ̃kwel ɛ̃ byɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Okɛɛn byɛ eli baal b'ɔ̃kiri, kɛn ɔ̃kiri akaadzii ba ndɛ. Kɛn onge bɛn byɛ k'eli b'ɔ̃kiri wɛ, bvool me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ nsueel byɛ onse ɔ̃kiri, obɔ otsɛn bɛn ɔ̃kiri oli ye byal e byɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Ebee ãndɔɔ m'elieel mɛ̃ byɛ mã odzɛɛn: “Ɔ̃nkyal k'anduru mfam wɛ.” Okɛɛn bɔ atueel mɛ̃ mpal, bɔ akieel atuaal byɛ hɛ̃ mpal. Okɛɛn bɔ akwee Endɔɔ e mɛ̃, bɔ àkwɛɛ li byɛ hɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Bɔ àsa byɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel me nkuũ a mɛ̃, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ k'ayɛɛ wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Mɛ̃ al'okɛɛn k'eyi wɛ, bvool okɛɛn mɛ̃ k'eyɛɛn ye bɔ wɛ, kɛn bɔ k'akaakal y'obi wɛ. Kɛn a meba, bɔ k'abɔɔ odzeel me ndɔɔ obi o bɔ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Wu obyel mɛ̃, obyel Tal a mɛ̃ hɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Okɛɛn mɛ̃ k'esi ɛ̃sal myɛn mbuul ɔ̃kyam si ɔ̃mɔ̃ wu osi myɛ̃ pyɛ, kɛn bɔ k'akekal y'obi wɛ. Kɛn a meba, okyam ŋɛn bɔ amwɛn ɛ̃sal omyɛ̃, bɔ awɛɛl mpɛn m'obyal o mɛ̃ ye Tal a mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Kɛn eli me ndɔɔ yi asa m'ákel onse ngel a bɔ bubu: “Bɔ abyel mɛ̃ ngwel<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Ãnz 35.19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:5">69.5</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />«Ŋ'ekieel eya Ntwel, wu ekieel eyuɔɔl mɛ̃ byɛ, fa ola Taal, ndɛ wu Ɔ̃fel wu otaa-taa wu afa ola Taal, ndɛ wu akieel atsweel mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Byɛ, byɛ hɛ̃ ekieel etsweel mɛ̃, ke ngwel wɛ byɛ eli ye mɛ̃ fa obɛɛn.»<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />«Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ obobɔ, kwɛn okiool o byɛ obee obva. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Bɔ akieel atswɛɛl byɛ onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn. Bvool lio eyeya lɛn b'akieel abam byɛ atsam ndiri bɔ oŋɔ̃ ɔ̃sal a Nziã abesa. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Bɔ akieel asa obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ k'ayɛɛ onkyam Taal wɛ, k'ayɛɛ hɛ̃ onkyam mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ obobɔ, kwɛn ŋ'ekieel ekoo lio olɔ, byɛ, byɛ eyeel kwɛn mɛ̃ élieel byɛ mɔ̃ tsɔɔn.»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Ɔ̃sal wu Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">«Mɛ̃ k'elieel byɛ yɔ fa obɛɛn wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ eli ye byɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Meba, mɛ̃ ŋ'eyi ola wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃, kɛn a mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ pyɛ onse byɛ wu afuul mɛ̃ ndiri: “Yɛ kwɛn ayi ?” <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Kɛn onge bɛn mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ ɛ̃luul m'ãwua. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Kɛn a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ otaa-taa wɛn eli ye bvel me ndɔɔ a byɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ ndyam ngyi. Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn mɛ̃ ke ngyɛn wɛ, Ntwel k'àya ola byɛ wɛ. Kɛn okɛɛn mɛ̃ ngyɛn, mɛ̃ èyuɔɔl byɛ ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Ŋ'ekieel eya ndɛ, ndɛ àsuo baal b'ɔ̃kiri kal-a-kal ndɔɔ yi etal obi, ndɔɔ yi etal okal dzu, ye ndɔɔ yi etal otsiil b'ãndɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Me b'otal obi, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ k'alɔ okiool onse mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Me b'otal okal dzu, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ eyi ola Taal, bvool me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ bam k'ebemwɛn mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Me b'otal otsiil b'ãndɔɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn mfam a ɔ̃kiri wu, Nziã amaatsiil ndɔɔ a ndɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />«Mɛ̃ kɛn ndi y'ãndɔɔ bibi m'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ byɛ, kɛn a byɛ kɛn k'ekoo k'ebiri mɔ̃ onge pfuũ meba wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ŋ'ekieel eya Ɔ̃fel wu otaa-taa ndyam, ndɛ àbiri byɛ onse otaa-taa bueel, ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ k'ayɛɛn me nkuũ a ndyam wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ ayɛɛn me mbueel m'ekieel eyoo ndɛ, bvool akieel ayɛɛn m'ãfa ola mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Ndɛ akieel alweel mɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ akieel awal ãndɔɔ m'ãli mã mɛ̃, bvool àyɛɛn byɛ mɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Mbueel m'eli a Taal, ãli mã mɛ̃. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ndɛ akieel awal m'ãli mã mɛ̃, bvool àyɛɛn byɛ mɔ̃.»<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãwua ãkɔɔl esɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />«Esiil lio etsi-tsiri lɛn byɛ k'ebemwɛn mɛ̃ wɛ, bvool ke mbee a muaan-lio, byɛ èmwɛn mɛ̃ bvool.» <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Ayio a ndɛ ke kwɛ abvi oyɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Otsɛn o ndɔɔ oyɔ omã? Ndɛ olieel bia-byɛ ndiri: “Esiil lio etsi-tsiri lɛn byɛ k'ebemwɛn mɛ̃ wɛ, bvool ke mbee a muaan-lio, byɛ èmwɛn mɛ̃ bvool”, bvool ndiri: “Mɛ̃ èyi ola Taal.” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />“Lio etsi-tsiri” li elieel ndɛ, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri nki? Bia-byɛ k'ekwaal otsɛn o b'eyɛɛn ndɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Onge bɛn Yeso áyɛɛ kwɛn bɔ ákebii k'afuul ndɛ ɔ̃mfuul, ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ ebefuul byam-a-byam me ndɔɔ yi ndieel mɛ̃ wɛn: “Esiil lio etsi-tsiri lɛn byɛ k'ebemwɛn mɛ̃ wɛ, bvool ke mbee a muaan-lio, byɛ èmwɛn mɛ̃ bvool”. <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, byɛ, byɛ èlel bvool èluɔɔl, kɛn ɔ̃kiri àsia mpaa. Byɛ, byɛ èkal y'ãwua, kɛn ãwua ã byɛ ã̀kɔɔl esɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Ŋ'eyeburu ɔ̃kaal, ndɛ oli y'ãwua, me ndɔɔ yɛn lio li emwɛn ndɛ fool ŋ'ekoo. Kɛn a ŋ'eburu ndɛ muaan, ndɛ bvool k'abeyɛɛ fool e ndɛ wɛ, me ndɔɔ esɛ, ke ngwel wɛ aburu mbuul onse ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Obobɔ, byɛ bam eli y'ãwua meba. Kɛn a mɛ̃ èmwɛn byɛ bvool. M'emfa okyɛ, ɔ̃kwal a byɛ àluul m'osia mpaa, mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ hɛ̃ k'àkoo m'ombaal esɛ byɛ wɛ.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Me tsoo olɔ, byɛ k'èbefuul mɛ̃ ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ wɛ. Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn wɛn, ki èsɔɔ byɛ ola Taal, ndɛ àwa byɛ kyɛ me nkuũ a mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Tiil meba, byɛ kɛn esɔɔ eluɔ si ngemɔ̃ me nkuũ a mɛ̃ wɛ. Esɔɔ, byɛ èbɔɔ, kwɛn esɛ e byɛ ekal ɔ̃koo.»<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso obvel ɔ̃kiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />«Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ãmboo. Lio èyal lɛn mɛ̃ bvool k'ebeyɛɛn ye byɛ m'ãmboo wɛ. Kɛn a mɛ̃ èyɛɛn byɛ ãndɔɔ m'ãtal Taal kal-a-kal. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Me tsoo olɔ, byɛ ekieel esɔɔ eluɔ ola Taal me nkuũ a mɛ̃. Mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛn byɛ wɛn mɛ̃ wu ekieel esɔɔ eluɔ ola Taal me ndɔɔ a byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Taal ndyam oli ndoo a byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ bam èli andoo a mɛ̃, bvool byɛ ekiool bam ndiri mɛ̃, mɛ̃ mfi ola Nziã. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Mɛ̃ mfi ola Taal ngyi onse ɔ̃kiri. Meba ŋã, mɛ̃ ngya ambal ɔ̃kiri, bvool ngyii eyi ola Taal.» <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Ayio a ndɛ ayɛɛn ndiri: «Meba ŋã, yɛ booyɛɛn kal-a-kal, k'ebeyɛɛn m'ãmboo wɛ! <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Meba, bee ŋ'eyɛɛ wɛn yɛ yɛɛ mbueel, bvool wɛn yɛ k'eli ye kɔɔ lɛn mbuul afuul yɛ ɛ̃mfuul wɛ. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn bee ekiool wɛn yɛ fi ola Nziã.» <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ ŋ'ekiool meba? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Lio èyeya, lɔ emeeya, lɛn byɛ ètsɔɔn, mbuul bwɛn a mbuul ke mboo a ndɛ, bvool byɛ èsiil mɛ̃ myam. Kɛn a mɛ̃ ke ndi myam wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ Taal oli ye mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, kwɛn byɛ ekal y'opi onse mɛ̃. Onse ɔ̃kiri, byɛ emwɛn fool. Kɛn a byɛ, ekal y'ɔ̃dzɔɔ̃! Mɛ̃ ndyam mvel ɔ̃kiri.»<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso obuɛɛn me ndɔɔ ayio a ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Ke mbee a ŋ'eyɛɛn Yeso ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, ndɛ oseel mviil ke ywel, bu abuɛɛn bubu: «Taal, lio emeekoo, lweel Muaan a yɛ, kwɛn Muaan hɛ̃ alweel yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, onge b'éwi yɛ ndɛ okwɛn nkal a baal bueel, ndɛ hɛ̃ owi baal bueel b'ewi yɛ ndɛ elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu eli oyɛɛ o yɛ, yɛ wu Nziã kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃ wa taa-taa, y'oyɛɛ o Yeso Mãsia wu eyuɔɔl yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Mɛ̃ ndyam ndweel yɛ me nsie, mɛ̃ man ɔ̃sal wu ewi yɛ mɛ̃ osa. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Oŋɔ̃ meba, yɛ wu Taal, wa mɛ̃ lweel ke nkwel a yam, lweel li éli a mɛ̃ ye yɛ, ye k'asa ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="JHN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Mɛ̃ nsuo nkuũ a yɛ ola baal b'ewel yɛ onse ɔ̃kiri, bu wi mɛ̃. Bɔ áli ba yɛ, yɛ wi mɛ̃ bɔ, obobɔ bɔ akwee Endɔɔ e yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Meba, bɔ ayɛɛ kwɛn bvieel bvi ewi yɛ mɛ̃ efi ola yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ngwi bɔ ãndɔɔ m'ewi yɛ mɛ̃. Bɔ ayɔɔ mɔ̃. Bɔ ayɛɛ bam ndiri mɛ̃ mfi ola yɛ, bɔ hɛ̃ akiool ndiri yɛ wu oyuɔɔl mɛ̃.»<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />«Mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a bɔ ebuɛɛn. Mɛ̃ ke me ndɔɔ a ɔ̃kiri ebuɛɛn wɛ, mɛ̃ ebuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a b'ewi yɛ mɛ̃, nzal-a-ŋɛn bɔ ali ba yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, eluɔ bvieel bvi ndi a mɛ̃, eli bvi yɛ, bvi eli a yɛ hɛ̃, eli bvi mɛ̃. Obobɔ, lweel e mɛ̃ emɔɔn onse bɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Alili ŋã, mɛ̃ bvool k'ebekal onse ɔ̃kiri wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ŋ'eya ola yɛ, bɔ asiil onse ɔ̃kiri. Taal wu oli Ɔ̃nsensal, kiaal bɔ me mpɛn a nkuũ a yɛ, nkuũ yi ewi yɛ mɛ̃, kwɛn bɔ akal mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ onge b'eli bia-yɛ bvoo onge mbuul ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Ŋ'éli mɛ̃ kɛn ye bɔ, mɛ̃ bam ékekiaal bɔ me nkuũ a yɛ, nkuũ yi ewi yɛ mɛ̃. Mɛ̃ nkwee bɔ, onkyam ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ wu odziɔɔn pyɛ, okɛɛn ke kɛn a ndɛ ondɛ wu muaan wu odziɔɔn wɛ. Oŋɔ̃ ŋ'asi ndɔɔ yi ákel onse Ɛ̃nkaan mi ngel<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:10">Ãnz 41.10</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Meba ŋã mɛ̃ ŋ'eya ola yɛ. Mɛ̃ èyɛɛn ãndɔɔ mã ŋe ndi mɛ̃ kɛn onse ɔ̃kiri, kwɛn esɛ e mɛ̃ onse bɔ ekal ɔ̃koo. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Mɛ̃ ndyam ngwi bɔ Endɔɔ e yɛ, ɔ̃kiri bu abyel bɔ, ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ k'ali b'ɔ̃kiri wɛ, onge bɛn mɛ̃ ke ndi wu ɔ̃kiri wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Mɛ̃ ke nsɔɔ ola yɛ k'ambaal bɔ onse ɔ̃kiri wɛ, ki nsɔɔ mɛ̃ kɛn a kyɛn yɛ kiaal ke nkwel Obi. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Bɔ k'ali b'ɔ̃kiri wɛ, onge bɛn mɛ̃ ke ndi wu ɔ̃kiri hɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Suul bɔ akal bam ba ngel, me nkuul otaa-taa. Endɔɔ e yɛ eli otaa-taa. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Onge bɛn yɛ ayuɔɔl mɛ̃ onse ɔ̃kiri, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ngyuɔɔl bɔ onse ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Me ndɔɔ a bɔ, myam nkab nzuru a mɛ̃ yueel ola yɛ, kwɛn hɛ̃ bɔ akal ba ngel me nkuul a otaa-taa.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Mɛ̃ ke mbuɛɛn kɛn a me ndɔɔ a bɔ wɛ, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ mbuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a b'akieel akiool mɛ̃ me nkuul ãtee ã bɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Mɛ̃ mbuɛɛn kwɛn bɔ akal kɛn a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃. Taal, yɔɔl kwɛn bɔ akal bvoo yɛ bia-yɛ onge b'eli yɛ bvoo ye mɛ̃, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ndi bvoo ye yɛ. Yɔɔl kwɛn bɔ akal mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ kwɛn ɔ̃kiri ayɛɛ ndiri yɛ wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Mɛ̃ ngwi bɔ lweel li ewi yɛ mɛ̃, kwɛn bɔ akal mbuul ngɔmɔ̃, onge b'eli bia-yɛ bvoo onge mbuul ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Mɛ̃ ekal onse bɔ bvool yɛ akal onse mɛ̃, m'emfa okyɛ bɔ akal bam ɔ̃koo onse bvoo. Obobɔ, ɔ̃kiri ayɛɛ kwɛn yɛ mbuul wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃, bvool kwɛn yɛ dzii bɔ onge b'edzii yɛ mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Taal, b'ewi yɛ mɛ̃, mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn mboo ye ndi mɛ̃, bɔ hɛ̃ akal ye mɛ̃, kwɛn bɔ amwɛn lweel e mɛ̃, lweel li ewi yɛ mɛ̃, ke ngwel wɛ yɛ ádzii mɛ̃ ye k'asa ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Taal wa dzu, ɔ̃kiri k'ayɛɛ yɛ wɛ, kɛn a mɛ̃ ndyam ngyɛɛ yɛ, bvool bɔ ayɛɛ ndiri yɛ mbuul wu ayuɔɔl mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Mɛ̃ nsi kwɛn bɔ ayɛɛ nkuũ a yɛ. Mɛ̃ bvool èsa kwɛn bɔ ayɛɛ yɔ, kwɛn dzii li edzii yɛ mɛ̃ ekal onse bɔ, bvool kwɛn mɛ̃ nkal onse bɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Osiin o Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Ke mbee a ŋ'ebuɛɛn Yeso, ndɛ opal y'ayio a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi ayi ongwel ɔ̃bwɔɔ wa Sedolon. Oŋɔ̃ éli ye nguun ngamɔ̃, ndɛ bu asam onse yɔ y'ayio a ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Yuda wu átiɔ ndɛ, áyɛɛ mboo oyɔ, ke ngwel wɛ, nsa bibi Yeso y'ayio a ndɛ ákebvɔɔn oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Yuda obiri nkel a ambwel-mbwel ba Lom, y'ankiaal a Nzɔ a Nziã b'éwi amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'afalisaye, bu atɔ ke nguun oyɔ. Baal obɔ áli y'ambunda, y'ɛ̃mpaã mi andɛɛl ã mbaa, y'ãta. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yeso wu áyɛɛ ndɔɔ yi ékeya me ndɛ, osyel tsotsoo a bɔ, bu ofuul bɔ ndiri: «Wu ebii byɛ nã?» <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Wu ebii bee Yeso wa Nadzelet.» Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ mpii ndɛ.» Yuda wu átiɔ ndɛ áli ye bɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Kɛn a ŋ'eyɛɛn Yeso bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ mpii ndɛ», bɔ abvool mbee, bu ayiool me nsie. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Ndɛ bvool ofuul bɔ ndiri: «Wu ebii byɛ nã?» Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Wu ebii bee Yeso wa Nadzalet.» <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mɛ̃ ndyam ndɛ. Okɛɛn wu ebii byɛ mɛ̃, oŋɔ̃ eyɔɔl b'asiil ayi.» <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Oŋɔ̃ ŋ'asi ndɔɔ yi élieel ndɛ wu Yeso ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ke nzeel mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ onse b'ewi yɛ mɛ̃ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl wu áli y'epwel, odzuru kyɛ, opfel ɔ̃sal a ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn kyɛ, bu atsɔɔ ndɛ tswi li elam. Nkuũ a ɔ̃sal ondɛ Malekos. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yeso bu alieel Piɛɛl ndiri: «Bveel epwel e yɛ onse nzɔ a kyɛ. Mɛ̃ k'enywã mbiɔ yi fool yi ewi Taal mɛ̃ wɛ?»<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abiri Yeso ola Ane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Nkel a ambwel-mbwel ye kapiri a bɔ, y'ankiaal b'amfam b'Ayuda asiin Yeso, bu akuru ndɛ ɛ̃sii. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Bɔ kɛn abiri ndɛ ola Ane, ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ wu Ane áli tal ɔ̃kal a Kayif wu áli ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn me mvel ondɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Kayif mbuul wu áwi Ayuda luo li: «Eli ye bvel ngamfɛn kwɛn mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ akwa me ndɔɔ a yam e baal.»<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛɛl otwɛn ndiri ndɛ k'ali ɔ̃yio a Yeso wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl bwɛn ɔ̃yio wukyɛ ákeluɛɛn a Yeso. Ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn áyɛɛ ɔ̃yio ondɛ. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ndɛ osam ye Yeso onse ekɔɔ e ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Kɛn a Piɛɛl osiil o nkwel-a-nzi, tsotsoo a ɔ̃nywa wu ekɔɔ. Obobɔ, ɔ̃yio wukyɛ ondɛ, wɛn ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn áyɛɛ ndɛ, opal oyɛɛn y'ɔ̃kaal wu akekiaal ɔ̃nywã wu ekɔɔ, bu aswɛɛl Piɛɛl. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Obobɔ, ɔ̃kaal wu ákekiaal ɔ̃nywã wu ekɔɔ olieel Piɛɛl bubu: «Yɛ hɛ̃ ke ngɔmɔ̃ onse ayio a mbuul wu li wɛ?» Piɛɛl obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, mɛ̃ ke ndi ɔ̃yio a ndɛ wɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Onge bɛn mfyɛ ékesa, asal y'ankiaal ábvool mbaa m'ãkal, bvool ákeywal yɔ. Piɛɛl hɛ̃ áli ye bɔ, bvool ákeywal mbaa.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn ofuul Yeso ɛ̃mfuul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn ofuul Yeso ɛ̃mfuul me ndɔɔ ayio a ndɛ bvool me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ m'ékeyiool ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ndya ngyɛɛn ye baal bueel kal-a-kal. Mɛ̃ ndyam ke ngyiool ãlio mbueel onse nzɔ ãbuɛɛn, bvool onse Nzɔ a Nziã, ke mboo yi ebebvɔɔn Ayuda bueel. Mɛ̃ ke ndi ye ndɔɔ yi ngyɛɛn mɛ̃ m'edziɔɔn wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Otsɛn omã b'efuul yɛ mɛ̃ ɛ̃mfuul? Fuul baal b'akeyoo mɛ̃, ãndɔɔ me ngyɛɛn mɛ̃ bɔ. Bɔ bam ayɛɛ me ãndɔɔ mɛn mɛ̃ ndyam ngyɛɛn bɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Ŋ'eyɛɛn Yeso obobɔ, ngɔmɔ̃ onse ankiaal b'áli oŋɔ̃, opfel ndɛ empal y'oyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Okyɛ emfa ki ebveel yɛ ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn?» <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Okɛɛn mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn obi-obi, suo obi obɔ. Kɛn okɛɛn mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn ngesɛ, ke ki ebɛɛl yɛ mɛ̃ emã?» <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Ane bu ayuɔɔl ndɛ m'ebwal ola Kayif wu ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛɛl bvool otwɛn Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl osiil ke mboo oyɔ me mbaa obeywal. Afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ hɛ̃ ke ngɔmɔ̃ onse ayio a mbuul wu li wɛ?» Kɛn a Piɛɛl otwɛn ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, mɛ̃ ke ndi ɔ̃yio a ndɛ wɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Ngɔmɔ̃ onse asal a ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn áli oŋɔ̃. Ndɛ áli eburu e mbuul wu étsɔɔ Piɛɛl tswi. Ndɛ ofuul Piɛɛl ndiri: «Wu emwɛn mɛ̃ ndyam ye Yeso onse nguun, ke yɛ wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Kɛn a Piɛɛl bvool otwɛn. Kɛn a me lio olɔ, nswee okueel.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso ke nkwel a Pilate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />M'epal-epal kwɔɔl, ambal ye Yeso ola Kayif, bu abiri ndɛ ke nzɔ a ɔ̃kwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ wu áli mbuul a Lom. Kɛn a bam b'amfam b'Ayuda k'asam onse nzɔ a ɔ̃kwɛn wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ adzii k'akal tsɛtsɛ, me ndɔɔ yi adza pfuun li Onduru. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn ɔ̃kwɛn ondɛ wɛn nkuũ Pilate opal onse nzɔ, oyemwɛɛn ye bɔ okwel-a-nzi bu afuul bɔ ndiri: «Ndɔɔ yi efɛn byɛ mbuul wu mã?» <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Okɛɛn ngamburu wu yi asi yi mbi pyɛ, kɛn bee ke k'ewa ndɛ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ yɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilate obveel bɔ ndiri: «Ewal ndɛ, etsiil ndɔɔ a ndɛ byam onge b'etam ngel a byɛ.» Ayuda abveel ndɛ bubu: «K'awi bee nkuul yi ebam mbuul wɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Okyɛ emfa ki ekoo ndɔɔ yi éyɛɛn Yeso me ndɔɔ yi asuo emfa ki epfu li ekieel ekwa ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pilate obvool onse nzɔ, oti Yeso mbel, bu afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ ndyam mfam a Ayuda li?» <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ omɔ̃ ãtsam ã yam, wuo baal akyam ayɛɛn yɛ obobɔ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃?» <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilate obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ mɛ̃ Ɔ̃yuda aloo? Baal b'ɔ̃kiri a yam y'angaa-a-Nziã b'anɛn, b'awi yɛ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ mɛ̃! Ki esi yɛ emã?» <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Okwɛn o mɛ̃ k'oli b'ɔ̃kiri wu wɛ. Okɛɛn bɔ oli b'ɔ̃kiri wu, kɛn asal a mɛ̃ akaadzwaan, kwɛn abee mɛ̃ me mviɔɔl mi Ayuda owa. Kɛn okwɛn o mɛ̃ k'oli bo nsie ŋã wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilate bu afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Ŋɛn yɛ ndyam ɔ̃kwɛn li?» Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ ndyam mbuul wu yɛɛn yɔ ndiri mɛ̃ ndi ɔ̃kwɛn. Mɛ̃, okɛɛn áburu mɛ̃, bvool okɛɛn mɛ̃ ngyi onse ɔ̃kiri, me ndɔɔ yi etsweel otaa-taa. Mbuul wueel wu oli onse otaa-taa ayoo m'eyɛɛn mɛ̃.» <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilate ofuul ndɛ ndiri: «Otaa-taa emã?»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 18:38">Awi Yeso etumbu ki epfu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Ke mbee a ŋ'efuul Pilate Yeso obobɔ, ndɛ wu Pilate bvool opal onkwel-a-nzi ke mboo yi éli Ayuda, bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Mɛ̃ ndyam ke mbɔɔ elyal si emɔ̃ ki ewa mɛ̃ mbuul wu etumbu ki epfu wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Kɛn onkɔɔ o byɛ ontam kwɛn mɛ̃ mpaal mbuul a bwal ngɔmɔ̃ me ndɔɔ a pfuun li Onduru, oŋɔ̃ eyɛɛn b'edzii byɛ: Mpaal byɛ ɔ̃kwɛn a Ayuda?» <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ m'ɛ̃sɔɔl ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, ke ngaburu ondɛ wɛ! Paal bee Balabas!» Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Balabas ondɛ wu ákelɔ tsungaa onse etswi e nsie.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Obobɔ, Pilate otam kwɛn abiri Yeso bvool ayuul ndɛ asikɔrɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Ambwel-mbwel atuu ekɔrɔ ki okwɛn m'ɛmbɛɛl mi y'ãnsiɛɛn, bu andɔɔl ndɛ kyɛ nkal ɔ̃tswɛ. Bɔ hɛ̃ alaal ndɛ ɔ̃nkuru wa bɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Bɔ asyel tsotsoo a ndɛ, bvool alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Ɔ̃kwɛn a Ayuda, bee ebio yɛ!» Bɔ bu ayuul ndɛ ãmpal. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilate opal bvool olieel Ayuda bubu: «Mɛ̃ ŋe ngyi byɛ ye ndɛ okwel-a-nzii ŋã, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn, mɛ̃ ke mbɔɔ elyal si emɔ̃ ki ewa mɛ̃ ndɛ etumbu ki epfu wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Yeso bu apal onkwel-a-nzi. Alaal ndɛ ekɔrɔ ki okwɛn ki m'ɛ̃mbɛɛl mi ãnsiɛɛn y'ɔ̃nkuru wa bɛ. Pilate bu alieel bɔ ndiri: «Mbuul ondɛ bu!» <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Ŋ'emwɛn angaa-a-Nziã b'anɛn y'ankiaal ndɛ, bɔ abiool ndiri: «Bɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu! Bɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu!» Pilate olieel bɔ ndiri: «Byam eyebɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ndyam ke mbɔɔ elyal si emɔ̃ ki ewa mɛ̃ ndɛ etumbu ki epfu wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Ayuda abveel ndɛ bubu: «Bee bam eli ye ngel. M'emfa ki eyɛɛn ngel oyɔ, mbuul wu ebvaan akwa, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ olieel ndiri ndɛ oli Muaan a Nziã.» <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Ŋ'eyoo Pilate ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, esi ndɛ bvool buɔ bibi. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Ndɛ okɔɔl onse nzɔ bvool ofuul Yeso bubu: «Yɛ ndyam mbuul wa kwɛn li?» Kɛn a Yeso k'awi ndɛ ɔ̃mveel wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilate bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Wu ebee yɛ ndɔɔ obveel mɛ̃ ndyam? Yɛ ke yɛɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ ndi y'okwɛn b'epeel yɛ bvool b'ebɛɛl yɛ m'enkulusu wɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ k'eli sikal ye mbwel okwɛn nkal a mɛ̃ wɛ, okɛɛn ke b'ofi ywel wɛ. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mbuul wu owi mɛ̃ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ yɛ, osi obi b'onduru bo yɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Bɛɛn lio olɔ, Pilate oyii abii k'apaal ndɛ me bwal. Kɛn Ayuda abiool ndiri: «Ŋɛn yɛ paal ndɛ, yɛ ŋɛn ke li ndoo a ɔ̃kwɛn wu ɔ̃nɛn Sedzaal wɛ! Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wueel wu ayɛɛn ndiri ndɛ oli ɔ̃kwɛn, ɔ̃taal a Sedzaal ali.» <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Ŋ'eyoo Pilate ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, ndɛ otam k'abiri Yeso onkwel-nzi. Ndɛ obvi nsɛn ke mbal, ke «mboo yi atuu m'ãnkɔɔn» yɛn m'ɔ̃nywã wu Ebel ata me «Gabata». <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Éli tsoo li awal ɔ̃yɛɛl me ndɔɔ a pfuun li Onduru, sua ŋ'eyii tal dzu. Ndɛ bu alieel Ayuda ndiri: «Ɔ̃kwɛn a byɛ ndɛ obɔ!» <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Kɛn a bɔ abiool ndiri: «Bam ndɛ! Bam ndɛ! Bɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu!» Pilate ofuul bɔ bubu: «Mɛ̃ mbɛɛl ɔ̃kwɛn a byɛ m'enkulusu?» Angaa-a-Nziã b'anɛn abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Bee ɔ̃kwɛn ɔ̃kyam pyɛ, kɛn a Sedzaal.» <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Obobɔ, Pilate bu awi bɔ Yeso kwɛn abɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 19:16">Abɛɛl Yeso m'ɔ̃ti</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Bɔ awel Yeso, bu ayɛn ye ndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Ndɛ obiri enkulusu e ndɛ ndyam, opal onse bviil bu ayɛn ke mboo yi ata me «Ebiɔ ki ɔ̃tswɛ», yɛn m'ɔ̃nywã wu Ebele ata me «Ngolongota.» <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Oyɔ mboo yi ebɛɛl bɔ ndɛ m'enkulusu. Bɔ hɛ̃ abɛɛl baal buaal akyam m'enkulusu tsotsoo a ndɛ, wɛn me kuɔɔl e ndɛ ki elam, wɛn me ki ekal, Yeso ndyam kal-a-kal. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilate otam k'aswɛn ãmpiri me muaan ebɛɛ, bu akwel lɔ m'enkulusu e Yeso. Nkal a muaan ebɛɛ olɔ áswɛn bubu: «Wu-bu Yeso wa Nadzalet, wu ɔ̃kwɛn a Ayuda.» <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Ayuda bibi atsiɔ ãmpiri omɔ̃, ke ngwel wɛ, mboo yi ábɛɛl Yeso m'enkulusu éli tsotsoo a bviil, bvool áswɛn ãmpiri omɔ̃ m'ɔ̃nywã wu Ebele, m'ɔ̃nywã wa Latɛ̃, bvool ye wa Ngelek. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Angaa-a-Nziã b'anɛn b'Ayuda ayɛɛn Pilate bubu: «Yɛ akaabee oswɛn wɛn: “ Wu ɔ̃kwɛn a Ayuda”, kɛn a swɛn wɛn: “Mbuul wu alieel ndiri: Mɛ̃ ndi ɔ̃kwɛn a Ayuda.”» <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilate obveel bɔ ndiri: «Ŋe nswɛn mɛ̃, ŋ'emeeswɛn!» <verse eid="JHN 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Ŋ'ebɛɛl ambwel-bwel Yeso m'enkulusu, bɔ awel ekɔ e ndɛ, bu akab bvɛ ãmboo ãnã, mbuul bwɛn a mbuul mboo ngamɔ̃. Bɔ hɛ̃ awel ekɔ e ndɛ ki abendɔɔl ke ywel ɔ̃nkuru, wɛn k'ábaan wɛ, bvool áli kɛn ekɔ ki ɔ̃tsiin fa ywel tiil nsie. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Bɔ ayɛɛn bam-bam ndiri: «Bia-byɛ ebee ɔ̃nkuru wu okɔɔl, eta ndɛ ebie, me ndɔɔ yi eyɛɛ mbuul wu awal ndɛ.» Okyɛ emfa ki ekoo ndɔɔ yi ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">«Bɔ akab ekɔ e mɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">bvool bɔ ati ebie m'ɔ̃nkuru a mɛ̃<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:19">Ãnz 22.19</ref></char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Okyɛ emfa ki ési ambwel-mbwel.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Ngoo a Yeso bwɛn a muaan-ngoo a ngoo a ndɛ, wɛn nkuũ Mali wu ɔ̃kal a Kelopas, bwɛn a Mali wu ola bo Magadala, átɛɛn tsotsoo a enkulusu e Yeso. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yeso omwɛn ngoo y'ɔ̃yio wu ékedzii ndɛ, tsotsoo a ndɛ wu ngoo, ndɛ olieel ngoo bubu: «Ngu, tal muaan a ye obɔ!» <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Ndɛ hɛ̃ olieel ɔ̃yio ndiri: «Tal ngoo a yɛ obɔ!» Bɛɛn lio olɔ, ɔ̃yio ondɛ owel Mali oyekal ola ndɛ.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Epfu e Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Ke mbee ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, me ndɔɔ yi asa mbueel m'ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã, Yeso wu áyɛɛ kwɛn mbueel ãmãakoo, olieel bubu: «Mɛ̃ ndi ye nzuaal<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Ãnz 69.22</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Tsotsoo oŋɔ̃, éli y'eluɔ ki éli tɔ me mbal ã ŋɛɛ̃. Ke nswɛɛ a ɔ̃mbɛɛl wu edzope, bɔ akuru mpɛɛl epɔ̃dze ki ebueel bɔ me mbal ã ŋɛɛ̃ omɔ̃, bu andɛɛl kyɛ k'ɔ̃nywã a Yeso. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Ŋ'enywi Yeso mbal ã ŋɛɛ̃ omɔ̃, ndɛ oyɛɛn ndiri: «Mbueel ŋ'ãkoo!» Ndɛ opfeel ɔ̃tswɛ, bu abveel ɔ̃fiaal ola Nziã.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atab Yeso ebɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Éli tsoo li ɔ̃yɛɛl me ndɔɔ a Pfuun li Onduru. Amfam b'Ayuda k'adzii kwɛn ebiĩ ekal nkal enkulusu me tsoo e saba wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ, saba ondɛ áli y'ɔ̃bvɛn bibi. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn bɔ ayesɔɔ ola Pilate bubu: «Tam kwɛn abwɔɔl baal ba nkal a enkulusu ɛ̃mpal, bvool akuul bɔ!» <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Ambwel-mbwel ayɛn, abwɔɔl ɛ̃mpal ɛ̃ baal ange-buaal b'abɛɛl m'enkulusu mboo mɔ̃ ye Yeso. Bɔ abɛɛn me wu ɛ̃kwel, bu abwel me wu buaal. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ ola Yeso, bɔ amwɛn kwɛn ndɛ amaakwa. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn bɔ k'abwɔɔl ndɛ ɛ̃mpal wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃ onse ambwel-mbwel otab Yeso ebɛɛ me yuo, ãkel y'ãdza bu ãmpal ɛ̃kiri anka oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Mbuul wu tsweel ãndɔɔ mã, amwɛn k'ebwel mɔ̃ me mviil m'ɔ̃tswɛ. Otsweel o ndɛ oli bo taa-taa. Ndɛ oyɛɛ bam kwɛn ndɛ ayɛɛn otaa-taa. Ndɛ atsweel mɔ̃ kwɛn byɛ hɛ̃ ekiool. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel ãbwel obobɔ, kwɛn asa m'ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri: «K'akieel abwɔɔl ɔ̃ywee a ndɛ sikal ɔ̃mɔ̃ wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Opa 12.46</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:21">Ãnz 34.21</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Ákel bvool ke mboo yinkyɛ ndiri: «Bɔ akieel atal ola ndɛ wu étab bɔ ebɛɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Dza 12.10</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alɔ Yeso onse mpiɛɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Ke mbee ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, Dzedzef wa bviil li Alimate, oyesɔɔ nkuul ola Pilate me ndɔɔ yi akuul ebiĩ e Yeso. Ndɛ hɛ̃ áli ɔ̃yio a Yeso m'edziɔɔn, ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ ákebal amfam b'Ayuda. Pilate owi ndɛ nkuul. Dzedzef bu ayekuul ebiĩ e Yeso. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodem hɛ̃ oyi. Ndɛ mbuul wɛn tsɔɔn áyi ola Yeso me tsia. Ndɛ oyi ye mbaal mã nswel yi mvɛ mã miil m'abvool y'alohes, mɔ̃ ãli akilo onse ab'ãku-ãtyel (30). <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Bɔ ange-buaal awel ebiĩ e Yeso, adzii kyɛ onse ɛ̃pa mi ekɔɔ mi eyiri bɔ mbaal nswel yi mvɛ omɔ̃. Okyɛ emfa ki ebesa Ayuda ŋ'ebelɔɔ bɔ ebiĩ onse mpiɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, éli ye nguun ngamɔ̃ ke mboo yi ábɛɛl Yeso m'enkulusu. Onse nguun oyɔ, éli ye mpiɛɛn yi alili yi átsam onse ãnkɔɔn yɛn kɛn ŋ'alɔ mbuul onse yɔ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Bɔ alɔ Yeso onse oŋɔ̃, me ndɔɔ yɛn éli tsoo li ɔ̃yɛɛl wa Pfuun li Onduru li Ayuda, ke ngwel wɛ mpiɛɛn oyɔ éli tsotsoo oŋɔ̃.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Osiool o Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Me tsoo li eyenge, m'epal-epal kwɔɔl, me lio lɛn empeel kɛn éli, Mali wa Magadala oyɛn ke mpiɛɛn. Ndɛ omwɛn kwɛn nkɔɔn yi ekii ɔ̃nywã a mpiɛɛn amaakeel. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Ndɛ otsuu ntiin oyebɔɔ Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl y'ɔ̃yio wukyɛ wu ekedzii Yeso. Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Ambaal Mfam onse mpiɛɛn, bee k'eyɛɛ mboo yi alɔ ndɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Piɛɛl y'ɔ̃yio wukyɛ ondɛ apal, bu ayɛn ke mpiɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Bɔ ange-buaal ákeyi me ntiin. Kɛn ɔ̃yio wukyɛ ondɛ onduru Piɛɛl me ntiin, ndɛ bu atɔ ke mpiɛɛn ɛ̃kwel. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Ndɛ opfɔɔn, omwɛn ɛ̃mpa mi ekɔ mi éli bɔ oŋɔ̃. Kɛn a ndɛ k'asam onse mpiɛɛn wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl wu ákeluɛɛn a ndɛ otɔ, bu asam onse mpiɛɛn. Ndɛ omwɛn ɛ̃mpa mi ekɔ mi éli bɔ oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />Ndɛ hɛ̃ omwɛn ekɔ ki ádzii m'ɔ̃tswɛ a Yeso. Ekɔ okyɛ k'éli bɔ oŋɔ̃ y'ɛ̃mpa mi ekɔ wɛ, kɛn ápfuru kyɛ me pyɛ, mboo nkyam. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Obobɔ, ɔ̃yio wukyɛ ondɛ, wu átɔ ke mpiɛɛn ɛ̃kwel, osam hɛ̃, ndɛ omwɛn bu akiool. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ayio ále kɛn akwaal otsɛn o m'ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri Yeso akieel asiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Ãnz 16.10</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ayio ange-buaal akɔɔl ke mboo yi ékekal bɔ.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso opal ola Mali wa Magadala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Mali áli okwel-a-nzi tsotsoo a mpiɛɛn, bvool ákelel. Ŋ'ebelel ndɛ oŋɔ̃, ndɛ opfɔɔn me ndɔɔ yi aliɔɔn onse mpiɛɛn. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Ndɛ omwɛn ãnzwel mbuaal m'ekɔ bvi afuu-fuu. Mɔ̃ ãbvi nsɛn ke mboo yi éli nzuru a Yeso bɔ, mɛn ke mboo yi éli ɔ̃tswɛ, mɛn ke yi éli ɛ̃mpal. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Ãnzwel omɔ̃ ãfuul Mali ndiri: «Ngu, Ki ebelel yɛ emã?» Ndɛ obveel mɔ̃ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ebelel, me ndɔɔ yɛn ambaal Mfam a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ mboo yi alɔ ndɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Ke mbee a ŋ'ebveel Mali obobɔ, ndɛ okaal nzuru bu amwɛn Yeso atɛɛn oŋɔ̃. Kɛn a ndɛ k'áyɛɛ ndiri ondɛ Yeso wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yeso ofuul ndɛ bubu: «Ngu, ki ebelel yɛ emã? Yɛ nã abii?» Mali áketsam ndiri ondɛ ɔ̃sal a nguun, ndɛ bu abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Taal, okɛɛn yɛ mbuul wu mbaal ndɛ, yɛɛn mɛ̃ mboo yi elɔ yɛ ndɛ, kwɛn mɛ̃ ngyi ndɛ owal.» <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yeso bu ati ndɛ ndiri: «Mali!» Ndɛ okɔɔl, bu alieel ndɛ m'ɔ̃nywã wu Ebel ndiri: «Rabbouni!» Ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee!» <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Bee mɛ̃ okwaal, ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ kɛn ngyɛn ywel ola Taal wɛ. Kɛn a yi, yɛɛn andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, ndiri mɛ̃ ngyɛn ywel ola wu oli Tal a mɛ̃, wu oli hɛ̃ Tal a byɛ, ola Nziã a mɛ̃, wu oli hɛ̃ Nziã a byɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Obobɔ, Mali wa Magadala oyewa nsia ol'ayio ndiri ndɛ omwɛn Mfam, bvool olieel bɔ ãndɔɔ m'elieel Mfam ndɛ.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso osuo nzuru ol'ayio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />M'ãnkunwal mã tsoo lili li eyenge olɔ, ayio ábvɔɔn onse nzɔ ngamɔ̃ bvool áwɔɔl edzoo e yɔ me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ákebal Ayuda. Yeso oyi, otɛɛn kal-a-kal a bɔ, bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Yɔɔl opi okal ye byɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ke mbee a ŋ'eyɛɛn ndɛ bɔ obobɔ, ndɛ osuo bɔ mviɔɔl y'ebɛɛ e ndɛ. Ayio aluul m'esɛ ŋ'emwɛn bɔ Mfam. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Ndɛ bvool olieel bɔ bubu: «Yɔɔl opi okal ye byɛ! Emfa ki étam Taal ndyam mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndyam hɛ̃ ntam byɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ke mbee ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, Yeso ofel ɔ̃fiaal nkal a bɔ, bvool oliee bɔ bubu: «Eyɔɔ Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal! <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />B'ekieel edzeel byɛ ãbi ã bɔ, abɔɔ odzeel. B'ekieel ebee byɛ ãbi ã bɔ odzeel, k'abɔɔ odzeel wɛ!»<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso ye Toma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, ngɔmɔ̃ onse ayio kuun ye buaal, wɛn nkuũ Toma, wu abeta hɛ̃ me Didime, k'áli ye bɔ me lio li éyi Yeso wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Ayio bakyɛ bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Bee emwɛn Mfam.» Kɛn a ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Ŋɛn mɛ̃ ke mwɛn ekel bvi ãnsal me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndɛ wɛ, ŋɛn mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ke mpio ɔ̃liɛɛn nkal ekel obvɛ, bvool ke ndɔɔl kuɔɔl nkal ebɛɛ e ndɛ wɛ, mɛ̃ k'èkiool bam wɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Ke mbee ãtsoo mpuɔ̃, ayio a ndɛ ábvɔɔn bvool onse nzɔ, Toma hɛ̃ áli ye bɔ, bvool nzɔ éli m'owɔɔl. Kɛn a Yeso oyi, otɛɛn kal-a-kal a bɔ, bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Yɔɔl opi okal ye byɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ olieel Toma bubu: «Pio ɔ̃liɛɛn a yɛ ŋã, bvool tal mviɔɔl ɛ̃ mɛ̃, siaal kuɔɔl e yɛ bvool ndɔɔl kyɛ nkal ebɛɛ e mɛ̃. Bee y'enkyam okal, kal y'okiool!» <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Toma obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam a mɛ̃, Nziã a mɛ̃!» <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ ŋe kiool me ndɔɔ yɛn yɛ mwɛn mɛ̃? Esɛ ola baal bɛn k'amwɛn mɛ̃ wɛ, kɛn a bɔ akiool!»<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otsɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yeso bvool ási emvieel bibi ke nkwel a ayio a ndɛ, bvɛn k'ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan wu wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Kɛn bvi ákel bvi, ákel bvɛ kwɛn byɛ ekiool wɛn Yeso oli Mãsia, Muaan a Nziã. Ŋɛn byɛ ekiool ndɛ, byɛ ebɔɔ elaã me nkuũ a ndɛ.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso opal ol'ayio a ndɛ nsiaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso osuo nzuru bvool ol'ayio, nku-a-nku a baã li Tibeliade. Tal emfa ki ésuo ndɛ nzuru. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl, ye Toma wu abeta hɛ̃ me Didime, ye Natanahel wu ola bo Kanaan ke nsie yi Ngalile, ye baan a Dzebede, y'ayio a Yeso buaal akyam, ábvɔɔn. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl olieel bɔ bubu: «Mɛ̃ ŋ'eyeswal answi». Bɔ alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Bee hɛ̃ eyi ye yɛ.» Bɔ ayɛn, bu asam onse ebɛɛ, kɛn a bɔ ki abɔɔ me tsia ondɛ pyɛ. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Ŋ'etsi bviil, Yeso otɛɛn k'ekwel. Kɛn ayio k'áyɛɛ ndiri éli ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yeso bu afuul bɔ ndiri: «Baan, byɛ eli ye ki-odza?» Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃!» <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Etyal okii me kuɔɔl ki elam ki ebɛɛ, byɛ èbɔɔ answi.» Bɔ bu atyel okii, kɛn a bɔ k'abekoo k'adzuru bɔ wɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn answi ánduru olɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Ɔ̃yio wu ékedzii Yeso bu alieel Piɛɛl bubu: «Eli Mfam!» Ŋ'eyoo Piɛɛl ndiri eli Mfam, ndɛ olaal ekɔ ki abendɔɔl ke ywel ɔ̃kuru, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ ámbaal kyɛ me ndɔɔ yi aswal. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Ayio bakyɛ ayi y'ebɛɛ, bu abvi okii b'óli tɔ m'answi odzuru. Bɔ k'áli lala y'ekwel wɛ, ametele sua ɔ̃nkam (100). <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Ŋ'epal bɔ ekwel, bɔ amwɛn mampa y'ãkal ã mbaa, mɛn ándɔɔl nswi nkal a mɔ̃. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «Eya y'answi ke kwɛ b'ebɔɔ byɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl osam onse ebɛɛ, bu adzuru okii k'ekwel. Bɔ óli tɔ m'answi b'anɛn sua ɔ̃nkam y'ãku-ãtaan y'atyel (153). Onkyam ŋɛn answi áli bam bibi, okii k'okɔɔl wɛ. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yeso bu alieel bɔ ndiri: «Eyedza!» Ɔ̃yio sikal ngɔmɔ̃ k'akie k'afuul ndɛ ndiri yɛ ndyam nã li wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ bueel áyɛɛ ndiri éli Mfam. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yeso osyel tsotsoo, owel mampa, bu akab bɔ ndɛ, ndɛ hɛ̃ owi bɔ nswi. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Oyɔ nsa yi tyel yi ésuo Yeso nzuru ol'ayio, fa osiool o ndɛ onse b'ákwi-ákwi.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso ye Piɛɛl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Ke mbee a ŋ'edzi bɔ, Yeso ofuul Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl bubu: «Simɔ̃, muaan a Dzaã, yɛ dzii mɛ̃ nduru emfa ki edzii bɔ ba mɛ̃?» Ndɛ obveel Yeso ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃, Mfam, yɛ bam yɛɛ wɛn mɛ̃ nzii yɛ.» Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Kiaal baan b'emɛmɛɛ̃ a mɛ̃.» <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yeso ofuul ndɛ li nsa yuaal ndiri: «Simɔ̃, muaan a Dzaã, yɛ dzii mɛ̃?» Ndɛ obveel Yeso ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃, Mfam, yɛ bam yɛɛ wɛn mɛ̃ ndi ndoo a yɛ.» Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Kal ɔ̃mbuaal a emɛmɛɛ̃ e mɛ̃.» <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Ndɛ ofuul ndɛ li nsa tyel ndiri: «Simɔ̃, muaan a Dzaã, yɛ li ndoo a mɛ̃?» Piɛɛl oyoo ãwua bibi me ndɔɔ yɛn Yeso ofuul ndɛ li nsa tyel ndiri: «Yɛ li ndoo a mɛ̃?» Ndɛ bu abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, yɛ yɛɛ ãndɔɔ mbueel. Yɛ yɛɛ bam wɛn mɛ̃ ebedzii yɛ!» Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Kiaal emɛmɛɛ̃ e mɛ̃. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɛ wɛn, ŋ'éli yɛ ndyam nsam a bɔɔl, yɛ ákelaal ɔ̃sii a yɛ me luu yam, bvool ákeyi mboo mbi pyɛ yi ékedzii yɛ oyi. Kɛn a ŋ'ekieel ekal yɛ ekukwel, yɛ akieel anaan kuɔɔl, mbuul ɔ̃kyam alaal yɛ ɔ̃sii me luu, bvool abiri yɛ ke mboo yɛn yɛ k'akedzii k'ayi yɔ wɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />M'ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, Yeso ákesuo emfa ki ekieel ekwa Piɛɛl, me ndɔɔ a lweel e Nziã. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Luɛɛn a mɛ̃!»<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso bwɛn ɔ̃yio wu ékedzii ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Ŋ'etal Piɛɛl mbee, ndɛ omwɛn ɔ̃yio wu ékedzii Yeso. Ɔ̃yio ondɛ wɛn me lio li ekedza bɔ, áyiɔɔn nkal otwel o Yeso me ndɔɔ yi afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, wu atiɔ yɛ nã?» Ɔ̃yio ondɛ hɛ̃ áluɛɛn a Yeso. <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Ŋ'emwɛn Piɛɛl ndɛ, ndɛ olieel Yeso bubu: «Mfam, yɛ yɛɛn omã me ndɔɔ a ndɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ŋɛn mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn ndɛ akal mwiĩ tiil lio li èyebvool mɛ̃, bo yɛ omã? Kɛn a yɛ, luɛɛn a mɛ̃!» <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Me ndɔɔ ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, nsia etsɔɔn onse andoo a dzii ndiri ɔ̃yio ondɛ kieel k'akwa wɛ. Ke yam, Yeso Piɛɛl k'obobɔ alieel wɛ, ndiri: «Ndɛ kieel k'akwa wɛ», kɛn a ndɛ alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Ŋɛn mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn ndɛ akal mwiĩ tiil lio li eyebvool mɛ̃, bo yɛ omã?» <verse eid="JHN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ɔ̃yio ondɛ wuwu, mbuul wu atsweel ãndɔɔ mã, bvool oswɛn mɔ̃. Bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn m'etsweel ndɛ ãli taa-taa.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osɛɛl b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yeso ási ãndɔɔ ãkyam bibi. Okɛɛn áswɛn mɔ̃ onse ɛ̃nkaan m'ɔ̃mɔ̃-mɔ̃, mɛ̃ etsam wɛn, ɔ̃kiri ɔ̃tsiin k'akal ye mboo me ndɔɔ okwɛɛ o myɛ̃ wɛ.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>